window.EXAM_DATA = {"id":"t1","title":"Topic 1 · completo","title_es":"Topic 1 · todas las preguntas (incluye secuenciales y Case Studies del Topic)","cases":{"CS2":{"title":"Case Study: Fabrikam, Inc.","en":"<h4>Background</h4>\n<p>Fabrikam, Inc., is a manufacturer of products for the gift industry. The company plans to implement Business Central as its new enterprise resource planning (ERP) system.</p>\n<p>The company sells to two types of customers: wholesale and retail. Retail customers order at special events and online. Wholesale customers send in orders by email.</p>\n<h4>Current Environment</h4>\n<p><b>Order processing</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The company uses a purchase order (PO) workflow for any PO over $500.</li>\n<li>The system has been fully configured for sales order prepayments and will check for a prepayment invoice at posting.</li>\n<li>Customers can special order products with a prepayment that is due on receipt.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Invoicing</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wholesale customer payment terms are net 30, with a 2% discount if paid within 10 days.</li>\n<li>Retail customer payment terms are payable on receipt or shipment.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Reporting</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The company uses headcount (number of employees) and square footage for statistical accounts.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Integrations</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The company currently uses Outlook, Excel, Word, and Teams to communicate internally and externally with customers and vendors.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Requirements</h4>\n<p><b>Order processing</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The company must be able to combine multiple purchase receipts into one vendor invoice.</li>\n<li>Posted vendor invoices must be reverted when damages are reported or a product is returned to the vendor.</li>\n<li>Fully invoiced POs must not appear on the PO list page.</li>\n<li>Customer prepayments vary based on customer relationship. Special orders from new customers have a 25% prepayment. Established customers have only a 15% prepayment.</li>\n<li>The company must be able to approve POs by email without opening Business Central.</li>\n<li>Customers often reorder the same items with similar quantities. The system must be configured to ask the user if recurring lines should be added to sales orders.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Invoicing</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customer revenue must be posted to separate general ledger (G/L) accounts based on customer type. The G/L account must have subcategories for wholesale and retail revenue.</li>\n<li>Accounts receivable must be posted to separate G/L accounts based on customer type. The G/L account must have subcategories for wholesale and retail accounts receivable.</li>\n<li>Currently, inventory is sold at a cost based on purchase and sales over a period.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Reporting</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Financial reports must include statistical accounts.</li>\n<li>The financial report structure must map to account categories.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Integrations</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create sales orders while collaborating with customers by email.</li>\n<li>Edit customer information while messaging the sales team in a group chat.</li>\n<li>Communicate a brochure to all customers at once about a sales campaign.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>General ledger posting accounts</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Retail Receivables = 13100</li>\n<li>Wholesale Receivables = 13200</li>\n<li>Payment Discount = 54800</li>\n<li>Retail Sales = 44100</li>\n<li>Wholesale Sales = 44200</li>\n<li>Sales Prepayments = 22160</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Issues</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Order entry takes too long for wholesale customers.</li>\n<li>Vendors ship partial orders but send one monthly invoice. The company is unable to associate one invoice with multiple POs in the current environment.</li>\n<li>Inventory reconciliation was difficult in the company's old system because it allowed users to sell more inventory than was physically available.</li>\n<li>Users must log in to the system to provide workflow approvals.</li>\n</ul>","es":"<h4>Contexto</h4>\n<p>Fabrikam, Inc. fabrica productos para la industria del regalo y va a implantar Business Central como nuevo ERP.</p>\n<p>Vende a dos tipos de clientes: mayoristas (wholesale) y minoristas (retail). Los minoristas compran en eventos especiales y online; los mayoristas envían los pedidos por email.</p>\n<h4>Entorno actual</h4>\n<p><b>Procesamiento de pedidos</b></p><ul><li>Hay un workflow de pedidos de compra (PO) para cualquier PO de más de 500 $.</li><li>El sistema está configurado para anticipos (prepayments) en pedidos de venta y comprueba la factura de anticipo al registrar.</li><li>Los clientes pueden hacer pedidos especiales con un anticipo pagadero a la recepción.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Facturación</b></p><ul><li>Clientes mayoristas: neto a 30 días, con un 2 % de descuento si pagan en 10 días.</li><li>Clientes minoristas: pago a la recepción o al envío.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Informes</b></p><ul><li>Usa la plantilla (número de empleados) y los metros cuadrados como cuentas estadísticas.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Integraciones</b></p><ul><li>Usa Outlook, Excel, Word y Teams para comunicarse interna y externamente.</li></ul>\n<h4>Requisitos</h4>\n<p><b>Procesamiento de pedidos</b></p><ul><li>Debe poder combinar varias recepciones de compra en una sola factura de proveedor.</li><li>Las facturas de proveedor registradas deben revertirse si hay daños o se devuelve el producto.</li><li>Los pedidos de compra totalmente facturados no deben aparecer en la lista de pedidos.</li><li>El anticipo depende de la relación con el cliente: pedidos especiales de clientes nuevos 25 %; clientes habituales solo 15 %.</li><li>Debe poder aprobar pedidos de compra por email sin abrir Business Central.</li><li>Los clientes suelen repetir los mismos productos con cantidades parecidas: el sistema debe preguntar si añadir las líneas recurrentes a los pedidos de venta.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Facturación</b></p><ul><li>Los ingresos deben registrarse en cuentas distintas según el tipo de cliente, con subcategorías para mayorista y minorista.</li><li>Las cuentas a cobrar deben registrarse en cuentas distintas según el tipo de cliente, con subcategorías para mayorista y minorista.</li><li>Hoy el inventario se vende a un coste basado en compras y ventas de un periodo.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Informes</b></p><ul><li>Los informes financieros deben incluir cuentas estadísticas.</li><li>La estructura del informe financiero debe corresponder a las categorías de cuentas.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Integraciones</b></p><ul><li>Crear pedidos de venta mientras se colabora con clientes por email.</li><li>Editar datos de clientes mientras se chatea con el equipo de ventas en un chat de grupo.</li><li>Enviar a la vez a todos los clientes un folleto sobre una campaña de ventas.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Cuentas contables</b></p><ul><li>Retail Receivables = 13100</li><li>Wholesale Receivables = 13200</li><li>Payment Discount = 54800</li><li>Retail Sales = 44100</li><li>Wholesale Sales = 44200</li><li>Sales Prepayments = 22160</li></ul>\n<h4>Problemas</h4><ul><li>La introducción de pedidos de mayoristas es demasiado lenta.</li><li>Los proveedores envían pedidos parciales pero una sola factura mensual; hoy no se puede asociar una factura a varios pedidos.</li><li>La conciliación de inventario era difícil porque el sistema permitía vender más de lo que había físicamente.</li><li>Los usuarios deben entrar en el sistema para aprobar los workflows.</li></ul>"},"CS1":{"title":"Case Study: Northwind Traders","en":"<h4>Background</h4>\n<p>Northwind Traders is an independent, family-owned business. The company distributes natural pet products in the Northwest region of the country/region. Products are purchased directly from manufacturers and distributed by using its own fleet of trucks.</p>\n<p>When the company started, deliveries were within a three-hour radius of the warehouse. Due to regional growth, current deliveries require drivers to stay overnight on some routes. The company plans to open a second warehouse to expand the region and eliminate overnights for route drivers. The company also plans to hire a second group of employees to run operations in this new location. The finance and accounting teams will remain in the original location.</p>\n<p>The company uses a third-party system for financials and order management. The finance department stated that the company's fiscal year begins on July 1 and ends on June 30. The mm/dd/yyyy date format is used.</p>\n<p>As part of the expansion, the owner plans to upgrade to an ERP system and use Business Central to fulfill the company requirements and manage growth.</p>\n<h4>Current environment</h4>\n<p><b>Orders</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Orders are emailed to customer service and manually keyed into the inventory system.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Pricing and discounts</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customer pricing is determined by the customer market type. Customer market types are Retail, Veterinarian, and Breeder. Each customer is associated with only one market type.</li>\n<li>Vendors offer monthly promotions to customers by item, brand, or item category.</li>\n<li>Invoices should show each customer's base price, the discount amount, and the net price.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Accounts payable</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The company wants to expand vendor payment options in the new system.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Requirements</h4>\n<p><b>Customers</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The sales team must be able to: quickly set up new customers with the proper settings based on customer type; identify customers by market type. Customer posting groups will be used to identify which market the customer belongs to.</li>\n<li>Base price is determined by the customer market type.</li>\n<li>The sales department should receive a warning when entering the order if a customer is over their credit limit.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Sales</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customer discounts are offered for specific time frames by item, brand, or product category. Discounts should be added to sales lines automatically.</li>\n<li>Discounts must post to a unique general ledger (G/L) account.</li>\n<li>The business needs to be able to track revenue by location, market, and product category dimensions. Locations 100 and 200 will be set as default dimensions on the two warehouse locations. Food, treats, toys, and supplies are the required product categories, which will be set as default dimensions on the item cards. Each customer card will have a default market dimension.</li>\n<li>The sales manager wants to delete canceled orders and automatically archive them.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Warehouse</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Orders will be fulfilled from two possible warehouse locations.</li>\n<li>Product will be transferred between locations by using transfer orders.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Sales invoices</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Invoices will be posted after delivery.</li>\n<li>Invoices will be emailed to the customer.</li>\n<li>The sales department must be able to quickly correct posted invoices for: posted invoices that have not been paid; posted invoices that have been paid; posted invoices created from sales orders; posted invoices not created from sales orders.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Accounting</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The finance department requires that the company has 12 monthly accounting periods per fiscal year.</li>\n<li>Finance department users must be able to reconcile the accounts receivable (AR) subledger to the G/L account at month end.</li>\n<li>AR department users need the ability to settle and close invoices when customers take payment discounts after the payment discount date has passed. AR users should be allowed to accept or reject the payment tolerance.</li>\n<li>Accounts payable (AP) department users must be able to pay vendors by electronic funds transfer (EFT) and use a payment journal batch named EFT to process payments.</li>\n<li>When viewing G/L entries, the finance and accounting teams must be able to see debits and credits instead of a positive or negative amount.</li>\n<li>The company needs to be able to track expenses by department and location. The departments are sales, operations, and administration.</li>\n<li>AR must be able to correct cash application entries.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Issues</h4>\n<p><b>Payment application</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customers may have several stores that are responsible for their own orders and payments.</li>\n<li>Occasionally, AR clerks mistakenly apply payments to the incorrect customer invoice.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Invoicing</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>When items are delivered, customers refuse the items for reasons such as damaged or wrong item.</li>\n<li>After the invoices are posted, they must be corrected, which is time-consuming.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Warehouse</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The sales department and warehouse managers must have visibility into products that are in the process of being transferred between locations.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Accounts</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customer accounts are difficult to view by market type.</li>\n<li>The finance team does not have the ability to report revenue by customer type.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Accounting</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>AR users often find variances between the AR subledger and G/L account.</li>\n<li>Customers often take the payment discount after the payment discount date has passed, leaving open invoices for small amounts.</li>\n<li>The AP department is unable to pay vendors by EFT in the current system.</li>\n<li>Finance and accounting team members have trouble validating postings when they use only the amounts field on G/L entries.</li>\n<li>The finance department is unable to run financial reports by market. All revenue postings must reference a market.</li>\n</ul>","es":"<h4>Contexto</h4>\n<p>Northwind Traders es una empresa familiar independiente que distribuye productos naturales para mascotas en la región noroeste del país. Compra directamente a los fabricantes y reparte con su propia flota de camiones.</p>\n<p>Al principio, las entregas estaban a menos de tres horas del almacén. Con el crecimiento, algunas rutas obligan a los conductores a pasar la noche fuera. La empresa va a abrir un segundo almacén para ampliar la región y evitar esas noches, y contratará otro equipo para operar en la nueva ubicación. Finanzas y contabilidad seguirán en la ubicación original.</p>\n<p>Hoy usa un sistema de terceros para finanzas y gestión de pedidos. Su ejercicio (fiscal year) empieza el 1 de julio y termina el 30 de junio. Se usa el formato de fecha mm/dd/yyyy.</p>\n<p>Con la expansión, el propietario quiere pasar a un ERP y usar Business Central.</p>\n<h4>Entorno actual</h4>\n<p><b>Pedidos</b></p><ul><li>Los pedidos llegan por email a atención al cliente y se teclean a mano en el sistema de inventario.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Precios y descuentos</b></p><ul><li>El precio depende del tipo de mercado del cliente: Retail, Veterinarian y Breeder. Cada cliente pertenece a un solo mercado.</li><li>Los proveedores ofrecen promociones mensuales por producto, marca o categoría.</li><li>Las facturas deben mostrar el precio base, el importe del descuento y el precio neto.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Cuentas a pagar</b></p><ul><li>La empresa quiere ampliar las formas de pago a proveedores en el nuevo sistema.</li></ul>\n<h4>Requisitos</h4>\n<p><b>Clientes</b></p><ul><li>El equipo de ventas debe poder dar de alta clientes rápidamente con la configuración correcta según su tipo e identificar a los clientes por mercado. Se usarán los customer posting groups para identificar el mercado de cada cliente.</li><li>El precio base depende del mercado del cliente.</li><li>Ventas debe recibir un aviso al introducir el pedido si el cliente supera su límite de crédito.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Ventas</b></p><ul><li>Los descuentos se ofrecen durante periodos concretos por producto, marca o categoría y deben añadirse automáticamente a las líneas de venta.</li><li>Los descuentos deben registrarse en una cuenta contable (G/L) propia.</li><li>Hay que analizar los ingresos por las dimensiones ubicación, mercado y categoría de producto. Las ubicaciones 100 y 200 serán default dimensions de los dos almacenes; las categorías Food, Treats, Toys y Supplies serán default dimensions en las fichas de producto; cada cliente tendrá una dimensión de mercado por defecto.</li><li>El jefe de ventas quiere borrar los pedidos cancelados y archivarlos automáticamente.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Almacén</b></p><ul><li>Los pedidos se servirán desde dos almacenes posibles.</li><li>Los productos se moverán entre almacenes con transfer orders.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Facturas de venta</b></p><ul><li>Las facturas se registrarán después de la entrega.</li><li>Se enviarán al cliente por email.</li><li>Ventas debe poder corregir rápidamente facturas registradas: no pagadas, pagadas, creadas desde pedidos de venta y no creadas desde pedidos.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Contabilidad</b></p><ul><li>Finanzas necesita 12 periodos contables mensuales por ejercicio.</li><li>Finanzas debe poder conciliar a fin de mes el subledger de clientes (AR) con la cuenta contable.</li><li>AR debe poder liquidar y cerrar facturas cuando el cliente se toma el descuento por pronto pago después de la fecha de descuento, pudiendo aceptar o rechazar la tolerancia.</li><li>Cuentas a pagar (AP) debe poder pagar por transferencia electrónica (EFT) usando una sección del diario de pagos llamada EFT.</li><li>Al ver los movimientos contables, finanzas quiere ver debe y haber en lugar de importes positivos o negativos.</li><li>Hay que analizar los gastos por departamento (ventas, operaciones, administración) y ubicación.</li><li>AR debe poder corregir aplicaciones de cobros.</li></ul>\n<h4>Problemas</h4>\n<p><b>Aplicación de pagos</b></p><ul><li>Algunos clientes tienen varias tiendas responsables de sus propios pedidos y pagos.</li><li>A veces AR aplica los pagos a la factura equivocada.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Facturación</b></p><ul><li>Al entregar, los clientes rechazan productos (dañados, equivocados…).</li><li>Después de registrar las facturas hay que corregirlas, lo que lleva mucho tiempo.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Almacén</b></p><ul><li>Ventas y los responsables de almacén deben ver los productos que se están transfiriendo entre almacenes.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Cuentas</b></p><ul><li>Es difícil ver las cuentas de clientes por mercado.</li><li>Finanzas no puede informar de los ingresos por tipo de cliente.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Contabilidad</b></p><ul><li>AR encuentra a menudo diferencias entre el subledger de clientes y la cuenta contable.</li><li>Los clientes se toman el descuento después de la fecha, dejando facturas abiertas por importes pequeños.</li><li>AP no puede pagar por EFT con el sistema actual.</li><li>Finanzas tiene problemas para validar registros usando solo el campo Amount de los G/L entries.</li><li>Finanzas no puede sacar informes por mercado. Todos los registros de ingresos deben llevar un mercado.</li></ul>"}},"questions":[{"id":"t1q1","type":"build","en":"A company adds a user to Microsoft 365.<br><br>Existing user groups do not have the required permission sets for newly added users.<br><br>You need to assign a Dynamics 365 Business Central user group and permissions to the user and the company.<br><br>Which five actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Una empresa añade un usuario en Microsoft 365. Los user groups existentes no tienen los permission sets necesarios para los usuarios nuevos.<br><br>Debes asignar al usuario un user group de Business Central con sus permisos y la company.<br><br>¿Qué cinco acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Topic 1 · Q1","slots":5,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Assign the company to the user.","es":"Asignar la company al usuario."},{"id":"B","en":"Select Get New Users from Microsoft 365 / Update Users from Microsoft 365.","es":"Seleccionar Get New Users from Microsoft 365 / Update Users from Microsoft 365."},{"id":"C","en":"Create a user group.","es":"Crear un user group."},{"id":"D","en":"Select the user from the user list.","es":"Seleccionar el usuario en la lista de usuarios."},{"id":"E","en":"Assign the user group to the user.","es":"Asignar el user group al usuario."},{"id":"F","en":"Assign the user to the company.","es":"Asignar el usuario a la company."}]},{"id":"t1q2","type":"mc","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>When users create sales documents, the system must display an alert that shows the customer's remaining credit. The alert must also notify the user if the customer has any overdue payments.<br><br>You need to configure a credit limit and overdue payment warning.<br><br>What should you do?","es":"Una empresa usa Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>Al crear documentos de venta, el sistema debe mostrar un aviso con el crédito disponible del cliente y avisar también si el cliente tiene pagos vencidos.<br><br>Debes configurar el aviso de límite de crédito y de pagos vencidos. ¿Qué debes hacer?","src":"Topic 1 · Q2","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Configure the Block Customer field.","es":"Configurar el campo Blocked del cliente."},{"id":"B","en":"Configure the Late Payment Predict extension.","es":"Configurar la extensión Late Payment Prediction."},{"id":"C","en":"Select Both Warnings in the Credit Warnings field.","es":"Seleccionar Both Warnings en el campo Credit Warnings."},{"id":"D","en":"Enable the Exact Cost Reversing Mandatory field.","es":"Activar el campo Exact Cost Reversing Mandatory."}]},{"id":"t1q3","type":"mc","en":"You configure a cloud-based printer in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>Purchase orders printed by users must automatically print to the cloud-based printer.<br><br>You need to create a setup record for the user, report, and printer combination.<br><br>On which page should you create the setup record?","es":"Has configurado una impresora en la nube (cloud printer) en Business Central.<br><br>Los pedidos de compra que impriman los usuarios deben salir automáticamente por esa impresora.<br><br>Debes crear un registro de configuración para la combinación de usuario, informe e impresora. ¿En qué página debes crearlo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q3","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Printer Selections","es":"Printer Selections"},{"id":"B","en":"Printer Management","es":"Printer Management"},{"id":"C","en":"Report Layout Selection","es":"Report Layout Selection"},{"id":"D","en":"Report Selection – Purchase","es":"Report Selection – Purchase"},{"id":"E","en":"Document Sending Profiles","es":"Document Sending Profiles"}]},{"id":"t1q4","type":"mc","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central Online.<br><br>Users must be added to Business Central for the first time.<br><br>You need to add the users.<br><br>Which action should you use?","es":"Estás implantando Dynamics 365 Business Central Online.<br><br>Hay que dar de alta a los usuarios en Business Central por primera vez.<br><br>¿Qué acción debes usar?","src":"Topic 1 · Q4","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Get New Users from Microsoft 365","es":"Get New Users from Microsoft 365"},{"id":"B","en":"Create a new entry on the User Setup page","es":"Crear un registro nuevo en la página User Setup"},{"id":"C","en":"Update Users from Microsoft 365","es":"Update Users from Microsoft 365"},{"id":"D","en":"Import User Groups","es":"Import User Groups"}]},{"id":"t1q6","type":"drag","en":"You are setting up approval workflows in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to configure approver limits.<br><br>Which approver limit types should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate approver limit types to the correct requirements. Each approver limit type may be used once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Estás configurando approval workflows en Business Central y debes configurar los límites de aprobador.<br><br>¿Qué approver limit type debes usar para cada requisito? Cada tipo puede usarse una vez o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q6","valuesTitle":"Approver limit types","targetHeader":["Requirement","Approver limit type"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Direct approver","es":"Direct approver"},{"id":"V2","en":"Specific approver","es":"Specific approver"},{"id":"V3","en":"First Qualified approver","es":"First Qualified approver"},{"id":"V4","en":"Approver Chain","es":"Approver Chain"}],"targets":[{"en":"Route approval requests to the approver defined in Approval User Setup, regardless of the amount.","es":"Enviar la solicitud al aprobador definido en Approval User Setup, sin importar el importe."},{"en":"Route approval requests to the approver defined in the Workflow Response, regardless of the amount.","es":"Enviar la solicitud al aprobador definido en la respuesta del workflow, sin importar el importe."},{"en":"Route approval requests to a user who can approve requests for the required amount.","es":"Enviar la solicitud a un usuario que pueda aprobar el importe requerido."}]},{"id":"t1q7","type":"mc","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company wants to print financial statements by using a cloud-based printer.<br><br>You need to recommend the type of printer the customer should install.<br><br>Which type of printer should you recommend?","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y quiere imprimir los estados financieros en una impresora en la nube.<br><br>Debes recomendar el tipo de impresora que debe instalar el cliente. ¿Cuál recomiendas?","src":"Topic 1 · Q7","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Email","es":"Email"},{"id":"B","en":"System","es":"System"},{"id":"C","en":"Client default","es":"Client default"},{"id":"D","en":"Server default","es":"Server default"}]},{"id":"t1q8","type":"mr","en":"You create a test instance of Dynamics 365 Business Central and enter transactions for testing purposes. You create a production company instance in the same Business Central environment.<br><br>You need to copy the setup and master data from the test instance to the production instance without copying transaction data.<br><br>What are two possible ways to achieve the goal? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Creas una instancia de prueba de Dynamics 365 Business Central e introduces transacciones de prueba. Después creas una company de producción en el mismo entorno.<br><br>Debes copiar el setup y los master data (datos maestros) de la instancia de prueba a la de producción sin copiar las transacciones.<br><br>¿Cuáles son dos formas posibles de conseguirlo? Cada respuesta correcta es una solución completa.","src":"Topic 1 · Q8","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Use the Run Migration Now function from Cloud Migration Management","es":"Usar la función Run Migration Now de Cloud Migration Management"},{"id":"B","en":"Create and export a configuration package from the source company. Next, import into the destination company","es":"Crear y exportar un configuration package desde la company origen e importarlo en la company destino"},{"id":"C","en":"Use the Copy Data from Company function from the Configuration Worksheet page","es":"Usar la función Copy Data from Company de la página Configuration Worksheet"},{"id":"D","en":"Use the Copy function from the Companies page","es":"Usar la función Copy de la página Companies"}],"select":2},{"id":"t1q9","type":"drag","en":"You are creating companies for multiple customers in the cloud-based version of Dynamics 365 Business Central by using the assisted setup guide.<br><br>You need to create new companies.<br><br>Which templates should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate templates to the correct requirements. Each template may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Estás creando companies para varios clientes en Business Central online con la guía asistida.<br><br>¿Qué plantilla debes usar para cada requisito? Cada plantilla puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q9","valuesTitle":"Templates","targetHeader":["Requirement","Template"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Create New","es":"Create New"},{"id":"V2","en":"Evaluation","es":"Evaluation"},{"id":"V3","en":"Production","es":"Production"}],"targets":[{"en":"Create a company that has setup data and sample data.","es":"Crear una company con datos de configuración y datos de ejemplo."},{"en":"Create a company that does not have setup data.","es":"Crear una company sin datos de configuración."},{"en":"Create a blank company that has setup data but does not have sample data.","es":"Crear una company vacía con datos de configuración pero sin datos de ejemplo."}]},{"id":"t1q10","type":"mr","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a customer.<br><br>The customer wants to upload starting entries for all master data through a general journal on the last day of the current month.<br><br>You need to upload the data according to this requirement.<br><br>Which three functions should you select? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Estás implantando Dynamics 365 Business Central para un cliente.<br><br>El cliente quiere cargar los movimientos iniciales de todos los master data mediante un general journal (diario general) el último día del mes actual.<br><br>¿Qué tres funciones debes seleccionar?","src":"Topic 1 · Q10","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Vendors Opening balance","es":"Vendors Opening balance (saldo inicial de proveedores)"},{"id":"B","en":"G/L Accounts Opening balance","es":"G/L Accounts Opening balance (saldo inicial de cuentas de contabilidad)"},{"id":"C","en":"Calculate Inventory","es":"Calculate Inventory"},{"id":"D","en":"Get Standard Journals","es":"Get Standard Journals"},{"id":"E","en":"Customers Opening balance","es":"Customers Opening balance (saldo inicial de clientes)"}],"select":3},{"id":"t1q11","type":"mc","en":"You are setting+ up and testing a workflow with approval hierarchy in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>In Approval User Setup, you configure the following users:<br><br>You create and enable an approval workflow. You configure the workflow to use the approver limit type Approver Chain.<br><br>To test the workflow, User1 creates a purchase order for $1,100 and runs the Send Approval Request function.<br><br>You need to identify the actions that occur when the workflow runs.<br><br>Which set of actions occurs?<br><br><table class=\"qtable\"><thead><tr><th>User</th><th>Approval limit</th><th>Comments</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>User1</td><td>$500</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>User2</td><td>$1,000</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>User3</td><td>$5,000</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>User4</td><td></td><td>User4 is configured as a direct approver for User1.</td></tr></tbody></table>","es":"Estás configurando y probando un flujo de aprobación con jerarquía en Business Central.<br><br>En <b>Approval User Setup</b> configuras los usuarios que muestra la tabla.<br><br>Creas y activas un flujo de aprobación con el tipo de límite <b>Approver Chain</b>.<br><br>Para probarlo, User1 crea un pedido de compra de 1.100 $ y ejecuta <b>Send Approval Request</b>.<br><br>¿Qué acciones se producen al ejecutarse el flujo?<br><br><table class=\"qtable\"><thead><tr><th>Usuario</th><th>Approval limit</th><th>Comentarios</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>User1</td><td>500 $</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>User2</td><td>1.000 $</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>User3</td><td>5.000 $</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>User4</td><td></td><td>User4 está configurado como aprobador directo de User1.</td></tr></tbody></table>","src":"Topic 1 · Q11","options":[{"id":"A","en":"User4 will receive an approval request. Once approved, the purchase order is released.","es":"User4 recibe una solicitud de aprobación. Una vez aprobada, el pedido se lanza (released)."},{"id":"B","en":"User3 receives an approval request. Once User3 approves the request, the purchase order is released.","es":"User3 recibe una solicitud de aprobación. Cuando User3 la aprueba, el pedido se lanza."},{"id":"C","en":"User2 will receive an approval request. Once User2 approves the request, User3 will receive an approval request. Once User2 and User3 approve the request, the purchase order is released.","es":"User2 recibe una solicitud. Cuando User2 la aprueba, la recibe User3. Cuando User2 y User3 la han aprobado, el pedido se lanza."},{"id":"D","en":"User1 will receive an approval request. Once User1 approves the request, User2 must approve the request. Once User2 approves the request, User3 must approve the request. Once User3 approves the request, the purchase order is released.","es":"User1 recibe una solicitud. Cuando la aprueba, debe aprobarla User2 y después User3. Cuando User3 la aprueba, el pedido se lanza."},{"id":"E","en":"User3 will receive an approval request. Once User3 approves the request, the request is routed to User4 for approval. Once User4 approves the request, the purchase order is released.","es":"User3 recibe una solicitud. Cuando la aprueba, pasa a User4. Cuando User4 la aprueba, el pedido se lanza."}]},{"id":"t1q13","type":"mc","en":"A customer has premium licenses for Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to make all actions and fields for the Manufacturing and Service modules available to users.<br><br>What should you do?","es":"Un cliente tiene licencias Premium de Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>Debes hacer que todas las acciones y campos de los módulos Manufacturing (fabricación) y Service (servicio) estén disponibles para los usuarios.<br><br>¿Qué debes hacer?","src":"Topic 1 · Q13","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Assign users to the D365 BUS FULL ACCESS user group.","es":"Asignar los usuarios al user group D365 BUS FULL ACCESS."},{"id":"B","en":"Select the Premium option in the Experience field on the Company Information page.","es":"Seleccionar la opción Premium en el campo Experience de la página Company Information."},{"id":"C","en":"Assign SUPER permission sets to users.","es":"Asignar el permission set SUPER a los usuarios."},{"id":"D","en":"Assign users to the D365 BUS PREMIUM user group.","es":"Asignar los usuarios al user group D365 BUS PREMIUM."},{"id":"E","en":"Select the Custom option for the Company Badge field on the Company Information page.","es":"Seleccionar la opción Custom en el campo Company Badge de la página Company Information."}]},{"id":"t1q14","type":"drag","en":"You manage several companies within one Dynamics 365 Business Central database. Most users work in only one of these companies, where they have a specific role.<br><br>You need to set up security according to company requirements.<br><br>Which setup should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate setups to the correct requirements. Each setup may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Gestionas varias companies en una misma base de datos de Business Central. La mayoría de los usuarios trabaja solo en una de ellas, con un rol concreto.<br><br>Debes configurar la seguridad según los requisitos de la empresa.<br><br>¿Qué configuración debes usar para cada requisito? Cada configuración puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q14","valuesTitle":"Setups","targetHeader":["Requirement","Setup"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Permission Sets and Permissions","es":"Permission Sets and Permissions"},{"id":"V2","en":"Profile (Role)","es":"Profile (Role)"},{"id":"V3","en":"User Settings","es":"User Settings"},{"id":"V4","en":"Users and Security Groups","es":"Users and Security Groups"}],"targets":[{"en":"Assign a role center to a user.","es":"Asignar un Role Center a un usuario."},{"en":"Define the active profiles for a company.","es":"Definir los perfiles activos de una company."},{"en":"Allow users to work only within their own company.","es":"Permitir que los usuarios trabajen solo en su propia company."},{"en":"Set record security to limit user rights to view data from a table.","es":"Configurar seguridad por registro para limitar qué datos de una tabla puede ver el usuario."}]},{"id":"t1q15","type":"drag","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The purchasing manager wants to implement an approval system by using email notifications.<br><br>You need to set up the notification system.<br><br>Which setup should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate setup to the correct actions. Each setup may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Estás implantando Business Central. El responsable de compras quiere un sistema de aprobación con notificaciones por email.<br><br>¿Qué configuración debes usar para cada acción? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q15","valuesTitle":"Setups","targetHeader":["Action","Setup"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Approval User Setup","es":"Approval User Setup"},{"id":"V2","en":"Notification Schedule","es":"Notification Schedule"},{"id":"V3","en":"Notification Setup","es":"Notification Setup"},{"id":"V4","en":"Workflow Response Options","es":"Workflow Response Options"}],"targets":[{"en":"Specify an approval administrator.","es":"Indicar un administrador de aprobaciones."},{"en":"Specify how the user receives notifications about approval requests.","es":"Indicar cómo recibe el usuario las notificaciones de solicitudes de aprobación."},{"en":"Specify that the user receives notifications on a weekly basis.","es":"Indicar que el usuario recibe las notificaciones semanalmente."}]},{"id":"t1q16","type":"mr","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You are unable to view some expected functionality in the system.<br><br>You need to demonstrate the use of different options for assigning profiles to users.<br><br>In which three places can you assign profiles to users? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Estás implantando Business Central. No ves algunas funcionalidades que esperabas.<br><br>Debes demostrar las distintas formas de asignar perfiles (profiles) a los usuarios. ¿En qué tres sitios puedes asignar perfiles a los usuarios?","src":"Topic 1 · Q16","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Assign a User Group to the user. Assign the Profile to the User Group.","es":"Asignar un User Group al usuario y asignar el perfil al User Group."},{"id":"B","en":"Assign a Profile on the User Personalization page.","es":"Asignar un perfil en la página User Personalization (hoy User Settings)."},{"id":"C","en":"Assign the Profile on the User card.","es":"Asignar el perfil en la ficha del usuario (User card)."},{"id":"D","en":"Accept the default Profile.","es":"Aceptar el perfil predeterminado (default profile)."},{"id":"E","en":"Add the user to the Profile card.","es":"Añadir el usuario a la ficha del perfil (Profile card)."}],"select":3},{"id":"t1q17","type":"mr","en":"A customer is using Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The customer is currently sending quotes and invoices using postal services. The customer wants to begin sending quotes and invoices by email directly from Business Central.<br><br>You need to configure outbound email.<br><br>What are two possible ways to achieve the goal? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Un cliente usa Business Central y envía ofertas y facturas por correo postal. Quiere enviarlas por email directamente desde Business Central.<br><br>Debes configurar el correo saliente. ¿Cuáles son dos formas posibles de conseguirlo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q17","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Configure SMTP Mail Setup options.","es":"Configurar las opciones de SMTP Mail Setup."},{"id":"B","en":"Run the Set up your Business Inbox in Outlook assisted setup tool.","es":"Ejecutar la guía Set up your Business Inbox in Outlook."},{"id":"C","en":"Run the Set up email logging assisted setup tool.","es":"Ejecutar la guía Set up email logging."},{"id":"D","en":"Run the Email setup assisted setup tool.","es":"Ejecutar la guía de configuración asistida Email setup (Set Up Email)."}],"select":2},{"id":"t1q19","type":"drag","en":"A company is implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to create a new company that is configured similarly to an existing company. The existing company has data that must be used as a template for the new company.<br><br>Which tools should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate tools to the correct requirements. Each tool may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa implanta Business Central. Debes crear una company nueva configurada como otra existente, cuyos datos servirán de plantilla.<br><br>¿Qué herramienta debes usar para cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q19","valuesTitle":"Tools","targetHeader":["Requirement","Tool"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Assisted Setup","es":"Assisted Setup"},{"id":"V2","en":"RapidStart Services","es":"RapidStart Services"},{"id":"V3","en":"Configuration Questionnaire","es":"Configuration Questionnaire"}],"targets":[{"en":"Create the first essential data components of a company, such as the company name.","es":"Crear los primeros datos esenciales de la company, como su nombre."},{"en":"Run a series of setup tasks in a specific order and manually mark the tasks as completed once the tasks are finished.","es":"Ejecutar una serie de tareas de configuración en un orden concreto y marcarlas manualmente como completadas."},{"en":"Template the existing data and apply the template to the new company in a single process.","es":"Convertir en plantilla los datos existentes y aplicarla a la company nueva en un solo proceso."}]},{"id":"t1q20","type":"mr","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central. You create a role center page for all users.<br><br>Users must not be allowed to personalize the page.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>Which three actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Estás implantando Dynamics 365 Business Central. Creas una página Role Center para todos los usuarios.<br><br>Los usuarios no deben poder personalizar la página.<br><br>¿Qué tres acciones debes realizar? Cada respuesta correcta es parte de la solución.","src":"Topic 1 · Q20","options":[{"id":"A","en":"On the Profiles (Role) page, select the profile and select the User as the default profile option.","es":"En la página Profiles (Role), seleccionar el perfil y marcar la opción Use as default profile."},{"id":"B","en":"On the User card, set the status to Disabled.","es":"En la User Card, poner el estado (State) en Disabled."},{"id":"C","en":"On the Profiles (Role) page, select the profile and select the Show in Role Explorer column.","es":"En la página Profiles (Role), seleccionar el perfil y marcar la columna Show in Role Explorer."},{"id":"D","en":"On the Profiles (Role) page, select Enable the profile. Disable all other profiles.","es":"En la página Profiles (Role), habilitar el perfil (Enabled) y deshabilitar el resto."},{"id":"E","en":"On the Profiles (Role) page, select the profile and select the Disable Personalization option.","es":"En la página Profiles (Role), seleccionar el perfil y marcar Disable Personalization."}],"select":3},{"id":"t1q21","type":"drag","en":"You need to configure security for Dynamics 365 Business Central objects.<br><br>Which permission or set of permissions is allowed for each type of object? To answer, drag the appropriate permissions to the correct object types. Each permission set may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Debes configurar la seguridad de los objetos de Business Central.<br><br>¿Qué permiso o conjunto de permisos se admite para cada tipo de objeto? Cada uno puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q21","valuesTitle":"Permissions","targetHeader":["Object type","Permission"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Read, Insert, Modify, and Delete","es":"Read, Insert, Modify, and Delete"},{"id":"V2","en":"Execute","es":"Execute"}],"targets":[{"en":"Table","es":"Table"},{"en":"Page","es":"Page"},{"en":"Table data","es":"Table data"},{"en":"System","es":"System"}]},{"id":"t1q22","type":"hotspot","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The accounting manager wants to set up a complete Purchase Document Approval system with an approval hierarchy that meets the following requirements:<ul><li>Sara processes all purchase orders. Any purchase orders that Sara processes must be approved.</li><li>Michelle can approve purchase orders up to $10,000.</li><li>Shawn can approve the orders up to $50,000.</li><li>Purchase orders above $50,000 must be approved by Remy.</li></ul>You need to create the hierarchy.<br><br>Which hierarchy setup should be used for each limit? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Estás implantando Business Central. El responsable de contabilidad quiere un sistema completo de aprobación de documentos de compra con esta jerarquía:<ul><li>Sara procesa todos los pedidos de compra y todos deben aprobarse.</li><li>Michelle puede aprobar pedidos hasta 10.000 $.</li><li>Shawn puede aprobar pedidos hasta 50.000 $.</li><li>Los pedidos de más de 50.000 $ los aprueba Remy.</li></ul>¿Qué configuración de la jerarquía corresponde a cada límite?","src":"Topic 1 · Q22","rowsHeader":["Limit","Hierarchy setup"],"rows":[{"en":"Unlimited","es":"Ilimitado","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Remy as Approval user with no approver","es":"Remy como approval user sin aprobador"},{"id":"b","en":"Remy as Approval user with Shawn as approver","es":"Remy como approval user con Shawn como aprobador"},{"id":"c","en":"Shawn as Approval user with Michelle as approver","es":"Shawn como approval user con Michelle como aprobadora"},{"id":"d","en":"Michelle as Approval user with Shawn as approver","es":"Michelle como approval user con Shawn como aprobador"}]},{"en":"Purchase orders up to $50,000","es":"Pedidos de compra hasta 50.000 $","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Remy as Approval user with no approver","es":"Remy como approval user sin aprobador"},{"id":"b","en":"Remy as Approval user with Shawn as approver","es":"Remy como approval user con Shawn como aprobador"},{"id":"c","en":"Shawn as Approval user with Remy as approver","es":"Shawn como approval user con Remy como aprobador"},{"id":"d","en":"Shawn as Approval user with no approver","es":"Shawn como approval user sin aprobador"}]},{"en":"Purchase orders up to $10,000","es":"Pedidos de compra hasta 10.000 $","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Michelle as Approval user with no approver","es":"Michelle como approval user sin aprobador"},{"id":"b","en":"Michelle as Approval user with Shawn as approver","es":"Michelle como approval user con Shawn como aprobador"},{"id":"c","en":"Shawn as Approval user with Remy as approver","es":"Shawn como approval user con Remy como aprobador"},{"id":"d","en":"Sara as Approval user with no approver","es":"Sara como approval user sin aprobador"}]},{"en":"Everything must be approved","es":"Todo debe aprobarse","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Sara as Approval user with no approver","es":"Sara como approval user sin aprobador"},{"id":"b","en":"Sara as Approval user with Michelle as approver","es":"Sara como approval user con Michelle como aprobadora"},{"id":"c","en":"Michelle as Approval user with Shawn as approver","es":"Michelle como approval user con Shawn como aprobador"},{"id":"d","en":"Michelle as Approval user with Remy as approver","es":"Michelle como approval user con Remy como aprobador"}]}]},{"id":"t1q23","type":"mr","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central Online for a company. The company is migrating from a previous version of Business Central.<br><br>The company wants to migrate historical financial information from the previous fiscal year into the new database, including all analytical information.<br><br>You need to migrate data, including analytical information, by using a configuration package.<br><br>Which three steps should you use? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Estás implantando Business Central Online para una empresa que migra desde una versión anterior de Business Central.<br><br>Quiere migrar la información financiera histórica del ejercicio anterior, incluida toda la información analítica (dimensiones).<br><br>Debes migrar los datos con analítica mediante un configuration package. ¿Qué tres pasos debes usar?","src":"Topic 1 · Q23","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Create a configuration package. Then select the appropriate table.","es":"Crear un configuration package y seleccionar la tabla adecuada."},{"id":"B","en":"Export the table from the configuration package to Microsoft Excel. Adjust the file to include dimension information. Import the updated Excel table.","es":"Exportar la tabla del paquete a Excel, ajustar el archivo para incluir las dimensiones e importar el Excel actualizado."},{"id":"C","en":"Select the Dimensions as Columns field. Include all the dimension fields in the configuration package.","es":"Marcar el campo Dimensions as Columns e incluir todos los campos de dimensión en el paquete."},{"id":"D","en":"Export the configuration package.","es":"Exportar el configuration package."},{"id":"E","en":"Assign a data template to the configuration package.","es":"Asignar una data template al configuration package."}],"select":3},{"id":"t1q24","type":"mr","en":"You are configuring Dynamics 365 Business Central. You have a file containing balances for all general ledger accounts as of December 31, 2018.<br><br>You import the data into a General Journal batch. You enable the Force Doc. Balance option for the template.<br><br>When you attempt to post the batch, the following error message displays:<br><br>Out of balance -<br><br>You need to resolve the error.<br><br>Which three actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents a part of the solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Configuras Business Central y tienes un archivo con los saldos de todas las cuentas a 31/12/2018. Lo importas en una sección (batch) del General Journal y activas <b>Force Doc. Balance</b> en la plantilla.<br><br>Al registrar aparece el error <i>Out of balance</i>. ¿Qué tres acciones debes realizar para resolverlo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q24","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Ensure that the set of journal entry lines balance by posting date.","es":"Asegurar que las líneas cuadran por fecha de registro (posting date)."},{"id":"B","en":"Ensure that the set of journal entry lines balance by gen. posting type.","es":"Asegurar que cuadran por gen. posting type."},{"id":"C","en":"Ensure that the set of journal entry lines balance by amount.","es":"Asegurar que cuadran por importe (amount)."},{"id":"D","en":"Ensure that the set of journal entry lines balance by document no.","es":"Asegurar que cuadran por número de documento (document no.)."},{"id":"E","en":"Ensure that the set of journal entry lines balance by dimension set ID.","es":"Asegurar que cuadran por dimension set ID."}],"select":3},{"id":"t1q26","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>You are configuring default reports and layouts in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You must add new data items to the report and change the layout associated with the default Purchase Order report.<br><br>A developer creates and deploys a new report object that includes the new data items and layout.<br><br>You need to configure Business Central to use the new report object as the system default when printing purchase orders.<br><br>Solution: On the Report Selection – Service page, set the value of the Usage option to Order. Update the Report ID shown on the page to reflect the new report object.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Configuras los informes y diseños predeterminados en Business Central. Hay que añadir nuevos data items y cambiar el diseño del informe de pedido de compra (Purchase Order) predeterminado. Un desarrollador crea y despliega un nuevo objeto report con esos cambios.<br><br>Debes configurar Business Central para que use el nuevo informe como predeterminado al imprimir pedidos de compra.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> en la página <b>Report Selection – Service</b>, poner Usage = Order y cambiar el Report ID por el del nuevo informe.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q26","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q27","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>You are configuring default reports and layouts in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You must add new data items to the report and change the layout associated with the default Purchase Order report.<br><br>A developer creates and deploys a new report object that includes the new data items and layout.<br><br>You need to configure Business Central to use the new report object as the system default when printing purchase orders.<br><br>Solution: On the Report Selection – Purchase page, set the value of the Usage option to Order. Update the Report ID shown on the page to reflect the new report object.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Configuras los informes y diseños predeterminados en Business Central. Hay que añadir nuevos data items y cambiar el diseño del informe de pedido de compra (Purchase Order) predeterminado. Un desarrollador crea y despliega un nuevo objeto report con esos cambios.<br><br>Debes configurar Business Central para que use el nuevo informe como predeterminado al imprimir pedidos de compra.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> en la página <b>Report Selection – Purchase</b>, poner Usage = Order y cambiar el Report ID por el del nuevo informe.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q27","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q28","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>You are configuring default reports and layouts in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You must add new data items to the report and change the layout associated with the default Purchase Order report.<br><br>A developer creates and deploys a new report object that includes the new data items and layout.<br><br>You need to configure Business Central to use the new report object as the system default when printing purchase orders.<br><br>Solution: On the Custom Report Layouts page, select the new report object. Use the Update Layout function to force Business Central to use the current report design.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Configuras los informes y diseños predeterminados en Business Central. Hay que añadir nuevos data items y cambiar el diseño del informe de pedido de compra (Purchase Order) predeterminado. Un desarrollador crea y despliega un nuevo objeto report con esos cambios.<br><br>Debes configurar Business Central para que use el nuevo informe como predeterminado al imprimir pedidos de compra.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> en la página <b>Custom Report Layouts</b>, seleccionar el nuevo informe y usar <b>Update Layout</b> para que Business Central use el diseño actual.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q28","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q29","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to create a user account for a new salesperson. The account must have the same permissions as other salespeople.<br><br>How should you configure the system? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central. Debes crear la cuenta de un nuevo comercial con los mismos permisos que el resto de comerciales.<br><br>¿Cómo debes configurar el sistema?","src":"Topic 1 · Q29","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Action"],"rows":[{"en":"Add a new user.","es":"Añadir un usuario nuevo.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Add a user to User Setup from Dynamics 365 Business Central.","es":"Add a user to User Setup from Dynamics 365 Business Central."},{"id":"b","en":"Add a user to User Settings from Dynamics 365 Business Central.","es":"Add a user to User Settings from Dynamics 365 Business Central."},{"id":"c","en":"Update users from Microsoft 365.","es":"Update users from Microsoft 365."},{"id":"d","en":"Select New on the Users page from Dynamics 365 Business Central.","es":"Select New on the Users page from Dynamics 365 Business Central."}]},{"en":"Assign user permissions.","es":"Asignar permisos al usuario.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Apply indirect permissions to a user.","es":"Apply indirect permissions to a user."},{"id":"b","en":"Apply effective permissions to a user.","es":"Apply effective permissions to a user."},{"id":"c","en":"Assign user to a User Group.","es":"Assign user to a User Group."}]}]},{"id":"t1q30","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to customize sales invoice printouts to meet the following requirements:<ul><li>Display the customer city and then the postal code.</li><li>Display the company logo to the right of the customer address information.</li></ul>Where should you make the configuration change? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central. Debes personalizar la impresión de las facturas de venta para que:<ul><li>Se muestre la ciudad del cliente y después el código postal.</li><li>El logotipo aparezca a la derecha de la dirección del cliente.</li></ul>¿Dónde debes hacer cada cambio?","src":"Topic 1 · Q30","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Location"],"rows":[{"en":"Display the customer city and then the postal code.","es":"Mostrar la ciudad del cliente y después el código postal.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Location Code in Company Information page","es":"Location Code in Company Information page"},{"id":"b","en":"Local Address Format in General Ledger Setup page","es":"Local Address Format in General Ledger Setup page"},{"id":"c","en":"Local Cont. Addr. Format in General Ledger Setup page","es":"Local Cont. Addr. Format in General Ledger Setup page"},{"id":"d","en":"Require County/Region Code in Address in General Ledger Setup page","es":"Require County/Region Code in Address in General Ledger Setup page"}]},{"en":"Display the company logo to the right of the customer address information.","es":"Mostrar el logotipo a la derecha de la dirección del cliente.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Company Information page","es":"Company Information page"},{"id":"b","en":"General Ledger Setup page","es":"General Ledger Setup page"},{"id":"c","en":"Sales & Receivables Setup page","es":"Sales & Receivables Setup page"},{"id":"d","en":"Purchases & Payables Setup page","es":"Purchases & Payables Setup page"}]}]},{"id":"t1q32","type":"hotspot","en":"A company creates blanket purchase orders from inbound documents that are sent to Dynamics 365 Business Central by purchasing agents.<br><br>When a new blanket purchase order is created with a certain item, the system must send a procurement supervisor a request to approve the purchase order.<br><br>Purchase orders must not be posted until the procurement supervisor approves the purchase order.<br><br>You need to configure the system. To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa crea blanket purchase orders a partir de documentos entrantes. Cuando se crea uno con un artículo concreto, el sistema debe pedir la aprobación de un supervisor y no se puede registrar hasta que la apruebe.<br><br>¿Cómo debes configurar el sistema?","src":"Topic 1 · Q32","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Solution component"],"rows":[{"en":"Lock the record for newly created blanket purchase orders with the specific item.","es":"Bloquear el registro de los blanket purchase orders nuevos con ese artículo.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Incoming Documents","es":"Incoming Documents"},{"id":"b","en":"Power Automate flows","es":"Power Automate flows"},{"id":"c","en":"Security filters","es":"Security filters"},{"id":"d","en":"Business Central workflows","es":"Business Central workflows"}]},{"en":"Assign the security command that tells the system to lock the purchase order.","es":"Asignar la orden que indica al sistema que bloquee el pedido.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"When Event","es":"When Event"},{"id":"b","en":"Then Response","es":"Then Response"},{"id":"c","en":"On Condition","es":"On Condition"},{"id":"d","en":"Trigger","es":"Trigger"}]},{"en":"Assign the items that the system will want to use to trigger the locking of the purchase order.","es":"Asignar los artículos que deben provocar el bloqueo del pedido.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"When Event","es":"When Event"},{"id":"b","en":"Then Response","es":"Then Response"},{"id":"c","en":"On Condition","es":"On Condition"},{"id":"d","en":"Trigger","es":"Trigger"}]}]},{"id":"t1q33","type":"drag","en":"A company is implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to create posting details for the master data.<br><br>Which setting should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate settings to the correct requirements. Each setting may be used once, more than once, or not at all.<br><br>You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa implanta Business Central y debes definir los datos de registro de los master data.<br><br>¿Qué valor debes usar en cada caso? Cada uno puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q33","valuesTitle":"Settings","targetHeader":["Requirement","Setting"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"G/L Account","es":"G/L Account"},{"id":"V2","en":"General Prod. Posting Group","es":"General Prod. Posting Group"},{"id":"V3","en":"General Bus. Posting Group","es":"General Bus. Posting Group"}],"targets":[{"en":"Item","es":"Item"},{"en":"Vendor","es":"Vendor"},{"en":"Customer","es":"Customer"}]},{"id":"t1q35","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. There are three departments (ADM, PROD and SALES) that are set up as dimensions.<br><br>A customer wants to speed up the purchase invoice entry process for building materials by having the AP clerks fill purchase invoices without using dimensions. Monthly building expenses can vary between $5,000-$7,000 per month. The allocation of building expenses is as follows:<br><table class=\"qtable\"><tr><th>Department</th><th>Allocation</th></tr><tr><td>PROD</td><td>50 percent</td></tr><tr><td>SALES</td><td>25 percent</td></tr><tr><td>ADM</td><td>25 percent</td></tr></table><br>Allocation of the monthly building expense between dimensions is required at the end of each month.<br><br>You need to configure the system to automatically allocate building expense total balances each month between dimensions.<br><br>How should you configure recurring general journals? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Hay tres departamentos (ADM, PROD y SALES) configurados como dimensiones. Para agilizar la entrada de facturas de compra de materiales de construcción, los administrativos las registran sin dimensiones. El gasto mensual varía entre 5.000 y 7.000 $ y se reparte así:<br><table class=\"qtable\"><tr><th>Departamento</th><th>Reparto</th></tr><tr><td>PROD</td><td>50 %</td></tr><tr><td>SALES</td><td>25 %</td></tr><tr><td>ADM</td><td>25 %</td></tr></table><br>El reparto del saldo entre dimensiones debe hacerse al final de cada mes, automáticamente.<br><br>¿Cómo debes configurar el recurring general journal (diario periódico)?","src":"Topic 1 · Q35","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Solution component"],"rows":[{"en":"Select recurring method","es":"Recurring method","options":[{"id":"a","en":"F Fixed","es":"F Fixed"},{"id":"b","en":"V Variable","es":"V Variable"},{"id":"c","en":"RF Reversing Fixed","es":"RF Reversing Fixed"},{"id":"d","en":"BD Balance by Dimension","es":"BD Balance by Dimension"}]},{"en":"Set up recurring frequency","es":"Recurring frequency","options":[{"id":"a","en":"1M","es":"1M"},{"id":"b","en":"1D","es":"1D"},{"id":"c","en":"CM-1D","es":"CM-1D"},{"id":"d","en":"1D+1M-1D","es":"1D+1M-1D"}]},{"en":"Set up amount field","es":"Campo Amount","options":[{"id":"a","en":"$5,000","es":"5.000 $"},{"id":"b","en":"0","es":"0"},{"id":"c","en":"-$5,000","es":"-5.000 $"},{"id":"d","en":"$7,000","es":"7.000 $"}]}]},{"id":"t1q36","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>After you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return to it. As a result, these questions will not appear in the review screen.<br><br>You are configuring default reports and layouts in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You must add new data items to the report and change the layout associated with the default Purchase Order report.<br><br>A developer creates and deploys a new report object that includes the new data items and layout.<br><br>You need to configure Business Central to use the new report object as the system default when printing purchase orders.<br><br>Solution: On the Report Layout Selection page, select the new report object. Update the value to Custom Layout and select the updated layout.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Configuras los informes y diseños predeterminados en Business Central. Hay que añadir nuevos data items y cambiar el diseño del informe de pedido de compra (Purchase Order) predeterminado. Un desarrollador crea y despliega un nuevo objeto report con esos cambios.<br><br>Debes configurar Business Central para que use el nuevo informe como predeterminado al imprimir pedidos de compra.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> en la página <b>Report Layout Selection</b>, seleccionar el nuevo informe, cambiar el valor a Custom Layout y elegir el diseño actualizado.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q36","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q37","type":"drag","en":"You are implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central for a client.<br><br>You need to ensure that the user interface (UI) meets the client’s requirements.<br><br>Which approach should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate approaches to the correct requirements. Each approach may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Estás implantando Business Central para un cliente y la interfaz debe cumplir sus requisitos.<br><br>¿Qué enfoque debes usar para cada requisito? Cada uno puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q37","valuesTitle":"Approaches","targetHeader":["Requirement","Approach"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Personalize","es":"Personalize"},{"id":"V2","en":"Customize","es":"Customize"},{"id":"V3","en":"Design","es":"Design"}],"targets":[{"en":"Ensure that UI changes made are applicable only at the user level.","es":"Los cambios solo se aplican al usuario que los hace."},{"en":"UI changes must apply to all users in the environment and any extensions produced by the user.","es":"Los cambios se aplican a todos los usuarios del entorno y generan una extensión."},{"en":"UI changes must apply only to the Role Center to which they are specified.","es":"Los cambios solo se aplican al Role Center (perfil) indicado."}]},{"id":"t1q38","type":"drag","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. The company has two finance managers.<br><br>You need to configure approval workflow for purchase orders. Only one manager is required to approve a purchase order.<br><br>How should you complete the configuration? To answer, drag the pages to the correct requirements. Each page may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y tiene dos responsables financieros. Debes configurar el workflow de aprobación de pedidos de compra de modo que baste con que apruebe uno de ellos.<br><br>¿Qué página debes usar para cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q38","valuesTitle":"Pages","targetHeader":["Requirement","Page"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Workflow","es":"Workflow"},{"id":"V2","en":"Workflow User Group","es":"Workflow User Group"},{"id":"V3","en":"Workflow Category","es":"Workflow Category"},{"id":"V4","en":"Approval User Setup","es":"Approval User Setup"}],"targets":[{"en":"Create and enable a purchase order approval workflow.","es":"Crear y activar el workflow de aprobación de pedidos de compra."},{"en":"Set up the relevant sequence for the approval managers.","es":"Definir la secuencia de los responsables que aprueban."},{"en":"Enable parallel approval for two managers.","es":"Permitir la aprobación en paralelo de los dos responsables."}]},{"id":"t1q40","type":"drag","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The sales department requires an approval process for new products. A sales order of more than $10,000 must be approved by the sales director.<br><br>You need to set up a sales approval workflow.<br><br>Which page should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate pages to the correct requirements. Each page may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central. Los pedidos de venta de más de 10.000 $ con productos nuevos debe aprobarlos el director comercial.<br><br>¿Qué página debes usar para cada requisito? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q40","valuesTitle":"Pages","targetHeader":["Requirement","Page"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Approval User Setup","es":"Approval User Setup"},{"id":"V2","en":"Workflow User Group","es":"Workflow User Group"},{"id":"V3","en":"Workflow","es":"Workflow"}],"targets":[{"en":"Sales amount approval limit for users","es":"Límite de importe de aprobación de ventas de los usuarios"},{"en":"Sales document type for approval","es":"Tipo de documento de venta que se aprueba"},{"en":"Sales items in documents for approval","es":"Artículos de los documentos de venta que se aprueban"}]},{"id":"t1q41","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company plans to configure a customer card based on the following requirements:<ul><li>Process payments through a bank account.</li><li>Bill a different customer for invoices.</li><li>Print invoices in a specific language.</li></ul>You need to configure the customer card.<br><br>Which components should you use? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y quiere configurar la ficha de cliente para:<ul><li>Procesar los pagos a través de una cuenta bancaria.</li><li>Facturar a otro cliente.</li><li>Imprimir las facturas en un idioma concreto.</li></ul>¿Qué campo debes usar para cada requisito?","src":"Topic 1 · Q41","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Component"],"rows":[{"en":"Process payments through a bank account.","es":"Procesar los pagos a través de una cuenta bancaria.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Payment Terms Code","es":"Payment Terms Code"},{"id":"b","en":"Payment Method Code","es":"Payment Method Code"},{"id":"c","en":"Preferred Bank Account","es":"Preferred Bank Account"}]},{"en":"Bill a different customer for invoices.","es":"Facturar a otro cliente.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Contact name","es":"Contact name"},{"id":"b","en":"Bill-to customer","es":"Bill-to customer"},{"id":"c","en":"Ship-to code","es":"Ship-to code"}]},{"en":"Print invoices in a specific language.","es":"Imprimir las facturas en un idioma concreto.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Country/Region code","es":"Country/Region code"},{"id":"b","en":"Language code","es":"Language code"},{"id":"c","en":"Responsibility center","es":"Responsibility center"}]}]},{"id":"t1q42","type":"hotspot","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company plans to implement a cash receipt journal batch based on the following requirements:<ul><li>The cash receipt journal batch must use a bank account by default.</li><li>The cash receipt customer payments must be archived automatically in the posted journals.</li></ul>The company uses the accrual basis for accounting.<br><br>You need to configure the cash receipt journal batch.<br><br>Which options should you use? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y quiere una sección de diario de cobros (cash receipt journal batch) que:<ul><li>Use por defecto una cuenta bancaria.</li><li>Archive automáticamente los cobros registrados en los diarios registrados.</li></ul>La empresa usa contabilidad de devengo. ¿Qué opción debes usar para cada requisito?","src":"Topic 1 · Q42","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Option"],"rows":[{"en":"Cash receipt journal batch must use a bank account.","es":"La sección debe usar una cuenta bancaria.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Bank Account under Bal. Account Type","es":"Bank Account under Bal. Account Type"},{"id":"b","en":"G/L account under Bal. Account Type","es":"G/L account under Bal. Account Type"},{"id":"c","en":"Customer under Bal. Account Type","es":"Customer under Bal. Account Type"},{"id":"d","en":"Vendor under Bal. Account Type","es":"Vendor under Bal. Account Type"}]},{"en":"Cash receipt customer payments must be archived in posted journals.","es":"Los cobros deben archivarse en los diarios registrados.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Posting No. Series","es":"Posting No. Series"},{"id":"b","en":"Copy to Posted Jnl. Lines","es":"Copy to Posted Jnl. Lines"},{"id":"c","en":"Suggest Balancing Amount","es":"Suggest Balancing Amount"},{"id":"d","en":"Reason Code","es":"Reason Code"}]}]},{"id":"t1q43","type":"mc","en":"A company is using Dynamics 365 Business Central. The finance manager creates a new general ledger (G/L) account.<br><br>You need to configure the system to include the G/L account in the general journal reconciliation window.<br><br>What should you do?","es":"El responsable financiero crea una nueva cuenta de contabilidad.<br><br>Debes hacer que aparezca en la ventana de conciliación (Reconciliation) del general journal. ¿Qué debes hacer?","src":"Topic 1 · Q43","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Add this G/L account to the Bank Account Posting Group.","es":"Añadir la cuenta al Bank Account Posting Group."},{"id":"B","en":"Enable the Direct Posting field in the G/L account card.","es":"Activar Direct Posting en la ficha de la cuenta."},{"id":"C","en":"Enable the Reconciliation Account field in the G/L account card.","es":"Activar Reconciliation Account en la ficha de la cuenta."},{"id":"D","en":"Create a new payment reconciliation journal.","es":"Crear un payment reconciliation journal nuevo."}]},{"id":"t1q44","type":"mc","en":"You are a functional consultant configuring items in Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You are configuring multiple units of measure for an item that has a base unit of measure of PCS and an additional unit of measure of BOX. One BOX holds 20 PCS of an item.<br><br>You need to define the relationship between the units of measure.<br><br>Which value should you populate on the Item Units of Measure page for the item?","es":"Eres consultor funcional y configuras productos en Business Central. Un producto tiene como unidad base PCS y una unidad adicional BOX. Una BOX contiene 20 PCS.<br><br>Debes definir la relación entre las unidades de medida. ¿Qué valor debes indicar en la página <b>Item Units of Measure</b>?","src":"Topic 1 · Q44","options":[{"id":"A","en":"For the BOX unit of measure, set the Qty. per Unit of Measure to 0.05.","es":"En BOX, Qty. per Unit of Measure = 0,05."},{"id":"B","en":"For the BOX unit of measure, set the Qty. per Unit of Measure to 20.","es":"En BOX, Qty. per Unit of Measure = 20."},{"id":"C","en":"For the PCS unit of measure, set the Qty. per Unit of Measure to 0.05.","es":"En PCS, Qty. per Unit of Measure = 0,05."},{"id":"D","en":"For the PCS unit of measure, set the Qty. per Unit of Measure to 20.","es":"En PCS, Qty. per Unit of Measure = 20."}]},{"id":"t1q47","type":"mr","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company plans to use multiple unit prices for the same items from different vendors.<br><br>You need to configure the purchase price of the items.<br><br>In which two locations can you configure the purchase price? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y quiere tener distintos precios unitarios para los mismos productos según el proveedor.<br><br>Debes configurar el precio de compra de los productos. ¿En qué dos sitios puedes configurarlo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q47","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Purchase order","es":"Purchase order"},{"id":"B","en":"Resource prices","es":"Resource prices"},{"id":"C","en":"Vendor card","es":"Vendor card"},{"id":"D","en":"Customer card","es":"Customer card"},{"id":"E","en":"Item card","es":"Item card"}],"select":2},{"id":"t1q48","type":"hotspot","en":"A client plans to implement Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to configure the system.<br><br>Which value posting type should you use? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Un cliente va a implantar Business Central y debes configurar el sistema.<br><br>¿Qué value posting debes usar para cada requisito?","src":"Topic 1 · Q48","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Value posting type"],"rows":[{"en":"Allow the user to change the default dimension value for the account type in a transaction.","es":"Permitir que el usuario cambie el valor de dimensión por defecto en una transacción.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Code Mandatory","es":"Code Mandatory"},{"id":"b","en":"Same Code","es":"Same Code"},{"id":"c","en":"No Code","es":"No Code"}]},{"en":"Prevent the user from posting a transaction without a dimension value for the account type.","es":"Impedir registrar una transacción sin valor de dimensión.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Code Mandatory","es":"Code Mandatory"},{"id":"b","en":"Same Code","es":"Same Code"},{"id":"c","en":"No Code","es":"No Code"}]},{"en":"Ensure that Business Central only accepts the default dimension value set for the account type in a transaction.","es":"Asegurar que solo se acepte el valor de dimensión por defecto.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Code Mandatory","es":"Code Mandatory"},{"id":"b","en":"Same Code","es":"Same Code"},{"id":"c","en":"No Code","es":"No Code"}]}]},{"id":"t1q49","type":"drag","en":"A company implements Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company must import the following opening balances into Dynamics 365 Business Central:<ul><li>Item</li><li>Bank</li><li>Customer</li></ul>You need to implement tools to import opening balances.<br><br>Which components should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate components to the correct opening balances. Each component may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.<br><br>NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","es":"Una empresa implanta Business Central y debe importar saldos de apertura de artículos, bancos y clientes.<br><br>¿Qué componente debes usar para cada saldo? Cada uno puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q49","valuesTitle":"Components","targetHeader":["Opening balance","Component"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"General journal","es":"General journal"},{"id":"V2","en":"Bank account reconciliation","es":"Bank account reconciliation"},{"id":"V3","en":"Item journal","es":"Item journal"}],"targets":[{"en":"Item","es":"Item"},{"en":"Bank","es":"Bank"},{"en":"Customer","es":"Customer"}]},{"id":"t1q53","type":"drag","en":"A company plans to set up an approval process for purchase orders in Business Central.<br><br>The approval process must automatically send out an approval request as soon as a purchase order is created. Purchase orders that require approval must be for an amount of $600 or more.<br><br>You need to configure the approval workflows.<br><br>Which areas should you configure for each use case? To answer, drag the appropriate areas to the correct use cases. Each area may be used once, more than once, or not at all.","es":"Una empresa quiere un proceso de aprobación de pedidos de compra que envíe la solicitud en cuanto se crea el pedido, para pedidos de 600 $ o más.<br><br>¿Qué área debes configurar para cada caso? Cada una puede usarse una vez, varias o ninguna.","src":"Topic 1 · Q53","valuesTitle":"Areas","targetHeader":["Use case","Area"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Approval User Setup","es":"Approval User Setup"},{"id":"V2","en":"Notification Schedule","es":"Notification Schedule"},{"id":"V3","en":"Workflow User Group","es":"Workflow User Group"},{"id":"V4","en":"Workflow Notification Setup","es":"Workflow Notification Setup"}],"targets":[{"en":"Activate the notification to be sent when a new purchase order is created.","es":"Activar la notificación al crear un pedido de compra nuevo."},{"en":"Configure the approval limit for purchase orders.","es":"Configurar el límite de aprobación de los pedidos de compra."},{"en":"Allow the user to receive notifications immediately.","es":"Permitir que el usuario reciba las notificaciones al instante."}]},{"id":"t1q54","type":"mc","en":"You are configuring Dynamics 365 Business Central security settings.<br><br>You assign the following permission sets to a user:<br><br>You need to determine how the system handles the user's permissions.<br><br>What is the outcome of the user permission configuration?<br><br><table class=\"qtable\"><thead><tr><th>Permission set</th><th>Object type</th><th>Object ID</th><th>Insert permission</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CustomerMgmt</td><td>Table data</td><td>18 (Customer)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>ReceivablesMgmt</td><td>Table data</td><td>18 (Customer)</td><td>(blank)</td></tr></tbody></table>","es":"Estás configurando la seguridad de Business Central. Asignas a un usuario los permission sets que muestra la tabla.<br><br>Debes determinar cómo trata el sistema los permisos del usuario. ¿Cuál es el resultado?<br><br><table class=\"qtable\"><thead><tr><th>Permission set</th><th>Object type</th><th>Object ID</th><th>Permiso Insert</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CustomerMgmt</td><td>Table data</td><td>18 (Customer)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>ReceivablesMgmt</td><td>Table data</td><td>18 (Customer)</td><td>(en blanco)</td></tr></tbody></table>","src":"Topic 1 · Q54","options":[{"id":"A","en":"The Yes option will allow a user to create a new customer.","es":"La opción Yes permitirá al usuario crear un cliente nuevo."},{"id":"B","en":"The permission set order will allow a user to create a new customer.","es":"El orden de los permission sets permitirá al usuario crear un cliente nuevo."},{"id":"C","en":"The Blank option will allow a user to create a new customer.","es":"La opción en blanco permitirá al usuario crear un cliente nuevo."}]},{"id":"t1q55","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. Each question in the series contains a unique solution that might meet the stated goals. Some question sets might have more than one correct solution, while others might not have a correct solution.<br><br>You need to transfer opening balances data into the system.<br><br>Solution: Import the data by using comma-separated values (CSV) files.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Debes transferir los datos de los saldos iniciales (opening balances) al sistema.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> importar los datos con archivos CSV (valores separados por comas).<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q55","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q56","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. (Serie: transfer opening balances.)<br><br>You need to transfer opening balances data into the system.<br><br>Solution: Use RapidStart Services to import the data.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Debes transferir los datos de los saldos iniciales (opening balances) al sistema.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> usar RapidStart Services para importar los datos.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q56","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q57","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. (Serie: transfer opening balances.)<br><br>You need to transfer opening balances data into the system.<br><br>Solution: Perform data migration by using the Data migration assisted setup wizard.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Debes transferir los datos de los saldos iniciales (opening balances) al sistema.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> migrar los datos con la guía de configuración asistida <b>Data migration</b>.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q57","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q58","type":"drag","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The finance manager requires a specific group of operating team users to have access only to a particular set of customer data.<br><br>You need to configure and enforce the security requirements.<br><br>Which pages should you configure? To answer, move the appropriate pages to the correct requirements.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central. El responsable financiero quiere que un grupo de usuarios solo acceda a un conjunto concreto de clientes.<br><br>¿Qué página debes configurar para cada requisito?","src":"Topic 1 · Q58","valuesTitle":"Pages","targetHeader":["Requirement","Page"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"User Card","es":"User Card"},{"id":"V2","en":"Profiles (Roles)","es":"Profiles (Roles)"},{"id":"V3","en":"Permission Sets","es":"Permission Sets"},{"id":"V4","en":"Microsoft 365 admin center","es":"Microsoft 365 admin center"}],"targets":[{"en":"Create security rules that will grant users required access.","es":"Crear las reglas de seguridad que dan a los usuarios el acceso necesario."},{"en":"Assign the predefined security rule sets to the requested users.","es":"Asignar esas reglas a los usuarios indicados."}]},{"id":"t1q59","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. (Serie: transfer opening balances.)<br><br>You need to transfer opening balances data into the system.<br><br>Solution: Transfer balances by using the Copy Company function.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Debes transferir los datos de los saldos iniciales (opening balances) al sistema.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> transferir los saldos con la función <b>Copy Company</b>.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q59","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q60","type":"mc","en":"A company recently implemented Business Central. The company uses Teams extensively for day-to-day collaboration.<br><br>The company finance manager must be able to search for contacts and share Business Central records in Teams.<br><br>You need to install the Business Central app in Teams.<br><br>What should you do first?","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y trabaja a diario con Teams. El responsable financiero debe poder buscar contactos y compartir registros de Business Central en Teams.<br><br>Debes instalar la app de Business Central en Teams. ¿Qué haces primero?","src":"Topic 1 · Q60","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Select the Share action on Attachment Documents in Business Central.","es":"Usar la acción Share de Attachment Documents en Business Central."},{"id":"B","en":"Search for Teams App Centralized Deployment in Business Central.","es":"Buscar Teams App Centralized Deployment en Business Central."},{"id":"C","en":"Add a Planner tab to a team channel.","es":"Añadir una pestaña de Planner a un canal del equipo."},{"id":"D","en":"Manage apps in the Business Central admin center.","es":"Gestionar apps en el Business Central admin center."}]},{"id":"t1q64","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. (Serie: transfer opening balances.)<br><br>You need to transfer opening balances data into the system.<br><br>Solution: Use a configuration package to import the data.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Debes transferir los datos de los saldos iniciales (opening balances) al sistema.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> usar un configuration package para importar los datos.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q64","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q68","type":"mc","en":"You are setting up a new company for a customer.<br><br>The customer wants to sell items in boxes and pallets, but refer to the items as pieces. Each box contains 12 pieces. Each pallet contains 144 pieces. You need to assign the unit of measures to items.<br><br>How should you assign the unit of measures?","es":"Configuras una company nueva. El cliente vende productos en cajas y palés, pero se refiere a ellos en piezas. Cada caja contiene 12 piezas y cada palé 144 piezas.<br><br>¿Cómo debes asignar las unidades de medida?","src":"Topic 1 · Q68","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Create Box as a base unit of measure. Add Pieces as an item unit of measure with the quantity per unit set to 0.08333.","es":"Crear Box como unidad base y añadir Pieces como unidad del producto con cantidad por unidad 0,08333."},{"id":"B","en":"Create Pallet as a base unit of measure. Add Pieces as an item unit of measure with the quantity per unit set to 0.0069.","es":"Crear Pallet como unidad base y añadir Pieces con cantidad por unidad 0,0069."},{"id":"C","en":"Create Pallet as a base unit of measure. Add Box as an item unit of measure with the quantity per unit set to 0.08333.","es":"Crear Pallet como unidad base y añadir Box con cantidad por unidad 0,08333."},{"id":"D","en":"Create Pieces as a base unit of measure. Add Pallet as an item unit of measure with the quantity per unit set to 144.","es":"Crear Pieces como unidad base y añadir Pallet como unidad del producto con cantidad por unidad 144."}]},{"id":"t1q69","type":"yn","en":"Note: This question is part of a series of questions that present the same scenario. (Serie: Page Inspection pane.)<br><br>A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>Functional users at the company must learn the data model behind pages to assist with troubleshooting.<br><br>You need to explain what users can inspect by using the Page Inspection pane.<br><br>Solution: View performance information on installed extensions that affect the selected page or its source table.<br><br>Does the solution meet the goal?","es":"<i>Nota: esta pregunta forma parte de una serie con el mismo escenario. Cada pregunta propone una solución distinta que podría cumplir el objetivo.</i><br><br>Una empresa usa Business Central. Los usuarios funcionales deben conocer el modelo de datos de las páginas para ayudar a resolver incidencias.<br><br>Debes explicar qué pueden consultar con el panel <b>Page Inspection</b>.<br><br><b>Solución:</b> ver información de rendimiento de las extensiones instaladas que afectan a la página o a su tabla origen.<br><br>¿Cumple la solución el objetivo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q69","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","es":"Sí"},{"id":"B","en":"No","es":"No"}]},{"id":"t1q70","type":"mr","en":"A customer is using Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The customer is currently sending quotes and invoices using postal services. The customer wants to begin sending quotes and invoices by email directly from Business Central.<br><br>You need to configure outbound email.<br><br>What are two possible ways to achieve the goal? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.","es":"Un cliente usa Business Central y envía ofertas y facturas por correo postal. Quiere enviarlas por email directamente desde Business Central.<br><br>Debes configurar el correo saliente. ¿Cuáles son dos formas posibles de conseguirlo?","src":"Topic 1 · Q70","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Run the Set up your Business Inbox in Outlook assisted setup tool.","es":"Ejecutar la guía Set up your Business Inbox in Outlook."},{"id":"B","en":"Run the Email setup assisted setup tool.","es":"Ejecutar la guía de configuración asistida Email setup."},{"id":"C","en":"Run the Set up email logging assisted setup tool.","es":"Ejecutar la guía Set up email logging."},{"id":"D","en":"Configure Email Accounts options.","es":"Configurar las opciones de Email Accounts."}],"select":2},{"id":"t1q71","type":"drag","en":"A company is implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to create a new company that is configured similarly to an existing company. The existing company has data that must be used as a template for the new company.<br><br>Which tools should you use? To answer, drag the appropriate tools to the correct requirements.","es":"Una empresa implanta Business Central. Debes crear una company nueva configurada como otra existente, cuyos datos servirán de plantilla.<br><br>¿Qué herramienta debes usar para cada requisito?","src":"Topic 1 · Q71","valuesTitle":"Tools","targetHeader":["Requirement","Tool"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Assisted Setup","es":"Assisted Setup"},{"id":"V2","en":"Configuration package","es":"Configuration package"},{"id":"V3","en":"Configuration Questionnaire","es":"Configuration Questionnaire"}],"targets":[{"en":"Create the first essential data components of a company, such as the company name.","es":"Crear los primeros datos esenciales de la company, como su nombre."},{"en":"Run a series of setup tasks in a specific order and manually mark the tasks as completed once the tasks are finished.","es":"Ejecutar tareas de configuración en un orden concreto y marcarlas manualmente como completadas."},{"en":"Template the existing data and apply the template to the new company in a single process.","es":"Convertir en plantilla los datos existentes y aplicarla a la company nueva en un solo proceso."}]},{"id":"t1q72","type":"mr","en":"A company uses Business Central.<br><br>The company requires the ability to track user logins.<br><br>You need to configure the system so administrators can monitor user activities.<br><br>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y necesita registrar los inicios de sesión de los usuarios.<br><br>Debes configurar el sistema para que los administradores puedan supervisar la actividad. ¿Qué dos acciones debes realizar?","src":"Topic 1 · Q72","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Configure User Setup.","es":"Configurar User Setup."},{"id":"B","en":"Enable time registration in General Ledger setup.","es":"Activar el registro de tiempo (Register Time) en General Ledger Setup."},{"id":"C","en":"Manage the Sessions page in the admin center.","es":"Gestionar la página Sessions en el admin center."},{"id":"D","en":"Access the User Time Register page.","es":"Acceder a la página User Time Register."}],"select":2},{"id":"t1q73","type":"mc","en":"You are setting up a new company for a customer.<br><br>The customer wants to sell items in boxes and pallets, but refer to the items as pieces. Each box contains 12 pieces. Each pallet contains 144 pieces.<br><br>You need to assign the unit of measures to items.<br><br>How should you assign the unit of measures?","es":"Configuras una company nueva. El cliente vende productos en cajas y palés, pero se refiere a ellos en piezas. Cada caja contiene 12 piezas y cada palé 144 piezas.<br><br>¿Cómo debes asignar las unidades de medida?","src":"Topic 1 · Q73","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Create Boxes as an item unit of measure with a quantity per unit of measure set to 1.","es":"Crear Boxes como unidad del producto con cantidad por unidad 1."},{"id":"B","en":"Create Pieces as a base unit of measure. Add Box as an item unit of measure with the quantity per unit set to 12.","es":"Crear Pieces como unidad base y añadir Box como unidad del producto con cantidad por unidad 12."},{"id":"C","en":"Create Pallet as a base unit of measure. Add Pieces as an item unit of measure with the quantity per unit set to 0.0069.","es":"Crear Pallet como unidad base y añadir Pieces con cantidad por unidad 0,0069."},{"id":"D","en":"Create Box as a base unit of measure. Add Pallet as an item unit of measure with the quantity per unit set to 12.","es":"Crear Box como unidad base y añadir Pallet con cantidad por unidad 12."}]},{"id":"t1q74","type":"mc","en":"A company is implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company must be able to assign transactions to unique and sequential numbers. Some transactions require multiple number series that can be used interchangeably.<br><br>You need to configure number series to meet the requirements.<br><br>What should you do?","es":"Una empresa está implantando Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>Debe poder asignar a las transacciones números únicos y secuenciales. Algunas transacciones necesitan varias number series (series numéricas) que se puedan usar indistintamente.<br><br>¿Qué debes hacer?","src":"Topic 1 · Q74","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Define number series codes on journal templates.","es":"Definir códigos de number series en los journal templates (libros del diario)."},{"id":"B","en":"Create relationships between number series.","es":"Crear relaciones entre number series."},{"id":"C","en":"Enable transaction tracking.","es":"Activar el seguimiento de transacciones."},{"id":"D","en":"Set up approval workflows.","es":"Configurar approval workflows (flujos de aprobación)."}]},{"id":"t1q75","type":"drag","en":"A company is implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central. The customer service team communicates daily with the customers by using Outlook.<br><br>The customer service team requires the following functionality in Outlook:<ul><li>Look up a business contact in Business Central when composing an email.</li><li>Create a sales quote and send it back to a customer without leaving Outlook.</li><li>Open a document in Business Central from the document number mentioned in an incoming email.</li></ul>You recommend that the team install the Business Central add-in for Outlook.<br><br>You need to recommend which add-in options the customer service team should use to meet the requirements.","es":"El equipo de atención al cliente usa Outlook a diario y necesita: buscar un contacto de Business Central al escribir un correo, crear y enviar una oferta de venta sin salir de Outlook, y abrir un documento de Business Central a partir del número citado en un correo entrante. Has recomendado el add-in de Business Central para Outlook.<br><br>¿Qué opción del add-in cubre cada función?","src":"Topic 1 · Q75","valuesTitle":"Options","targetHeader":["Function","Option"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Contact insights","es":"Contact insights"},{"id":"V2","en":"Document Link","es":"Document Link"},{"id":"V3","en":"Sync with Microsoft","es":"Sync with Microsoft"},{"id":"V4","en":"Incoming Documents","es":"Incoming Documents"}],"targets":[{"en":"Look up Business Central contacts when composing email.","es":"Buscar contactos de Business Central al escribir un correo."},{"en":"Create and send a sales quote without leaving Outlook.","es":"Crear y enviar una oferta de venta sin salir de Outlook."},{"en":"Open a document mentioned in an incoming email.","es":"Abrir un documento citado en un correo entrante."}]},{"id":"t1q76","type":"mc","en":"A company uses Business Central.<br><br>A finance manager must ensure compliance with accounting standards by accurately recording financial transactions based on the document date and the posting date.<br><br>You need to configure the system to synchronize document dates and posting dates on purchase documents.<br><br>What should you configure?","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central. El responsable financiero debe registrar las transacciones correctamente según la fecha del documento y la fecha de registro.<br><br>Debes configurar el sistema para sincronizar la fecha del documento con la de registro en los documentos de compra. ¿Qué debes configurar?","src":"Topic 1 · Q76","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Purchases &amp; Payables Setup","es":"Purchases & Payables Setup"},{"id":"B","en":"Feature Management page","es":"Feature Management page"},{"id":"C","en":"General Ledger setup","es":"General Ledger setup"},{"id":"D","en":"Document Sending Profiles","es":"Document Sending Profiles"}]},{"id":"t1q77","type":"hotspot","en":"A company is implementing Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The purchase manager plans to implement workflows for purchase order and vendor approvals. The workflows must be able to send notifications for new records and approval requests instantly by email.<br><br>All users require the same notification setup.<br><br>You need to set up the workflow notifications.<br><br>Which configurations should you use?","es":"El responsable de compras quiere workflows de aprobación de pedidos y proveedores que notifiquen al instante por email los registros nuevos y las solicitudes de aprobación. Todos los usuarios deben tener la misma configuración de notificaciones.<br><br>¿Qué configuración debes usar para cada requisito?","src":"Topic 1 · Q77","rowsHeader":["Requirement","Configuration"],"rows":[{"en":"Use the same notification setup for all users.","es":"Usar la misma configuración de notificaciones para todos.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"My notifications","es":"My notifications"},{"id":"b","en":"Workflow notification setup","es":"Workflow notification setup"},{"id":"c","en":"Change notification settings","es":"Change notification settings"},{"id":"d","en":"Notification setup on approval users","es":"Notification setup on approval users"}]},{"en":"Send notifications for new records and approval requests.","es":"Enviar notificaciones de registros nuevos y solicitudes de aprobación.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Notification type","es":"Notification type"},{"id":"b","en":"Notification method","es":"Notification method"},{"id":"c","en":"Notification schedule","es":"Notification schedule"}]}]},{"id":"t1q78","type":"hotspot","en":"You are configuring Dynamics 365 Business Central for a company.<br><br>The chief financial officer requires the following system functionality.<ul><li>Visibility into who creates or changes data without having the Change Log activated</li><li>Automatic email alerts for changes to critical setup fields</li><li>Visibility into who modifies the Business Central environment</li></ul>You need to configure the system to meet the requirements.","es":"El director financiero necesita: ver quién crea o cambia datos sin activar el Change Log, alertas automáticas por email de cambios en campos críticos y ver quién modifica el entorno de Business Central.<br><br>¿Qué debes configurar para cada requisito?","src":"Topic 1 · Q78","rowsHeader":["Business requirement","Configuration area"],"rows":[{"en":"Identify who created a record and when.","es":"Saber quién creó un registro y cuándo.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Page Inspection","es":"Page Inspection"},{"id":"b","en":"Field Monitoring setup","es":"Field Monitoring setup"},{"id":"c","en":"Azure Monitor","es":"Azure Monitor"},{"id":"d","en":"Telemetry","es":"Telemetry"}]},{"en":"Enable notification of changes in business-critical data.","es":"Notificar cambios en datos críticos.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Page Inspection","es":"Page Inspection"},{"id":"b","en":"Field Monitoring setup","es":"Field Monitoring setup"},{"id":"c","en":"Microsoft 365 admin center","es":"Microsoft 365 admin center"}]},{"en":"Define the email account for field-change notifications.","es":"Definir la cuenta de correo de las notificaciones.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"SMTP account","es":"SMTP account"},{"id":"b","en":"No email account","es":"No email account"},{"id":"c","en":"Current User Email","es":"Current User Email"},{"id":"d","en":"Exchange Online Account","es":"Exchange Online Account"}]},{"en":"Check who modified the Business Central environment.","es":"Comprobar quién modificó el entorno.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Azure Portal","es":"Azure Portal"},{"id":"b","en":"Microsoft 365 admin center","es":"Microsoft 365 admin center"},{"id":"c","en":"Power Platform admin center","es":"Power Platform admin center"},{"id":"d","en":"Business Central admin center","es":"Business Central admin center"}]}]},{"id":"t1q79","type":"mr","en":"A manufacturing company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company must be able to send sales documents and purchase orders to customers and vendors.<br><br>You need to set up email accounts to provide email access to users.<br><br>Which two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.","es":"Una empresa de fabricación usa Business Central y debe enviar documentos de venta y pedidos de compra a clientes y proveedores.<br><br>Debes configurar cuentas de correo para que los usuarios puedan enviar emails. ¿Qué dos acciones debes realizar?","src":"Topic 1 · Q79","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Assign email accounts based on the scenarios for which they are required.","es":"Asignar las cuentas de correo según los escenarios en que se necesiten."},{"id":"B","en":"Delegate which partner admins can use the tenant email account.","es":"Delegar qué partner admins pueden usar la cuenta de correo del tenant."},{"id":"C","en":"Set a limit on the number of messages an account user can send.","es":"Limitar el número de mensajes que puede enviar un usuario."},{"id":"D","en":"Specify who can view messages sent from other users.","es":"Especificar quién puede ver los mensajes enviados por otros usuarios."}],"select":2},{"id":"s1q5","type":"build","en":"You set up a new company for a customer.<br><br>The customer provides you with a Microsoft Excel file that contains master data.<br><br>You need to import the master data by using configuration packages.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Configuras una company nueva para un cliente, que te entrega un Excel con los master data.<br><br>Debes importarlos mediante configuration packages.<br><br>¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q5","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Import a populated Excel template into the sales header and lines","es":"Importar una plantilla de Excel rellena en la cabecera y las líneas de venta"},{"id":"B","en":"Import a populated Excel template into the package data","es":"Importar una plantilla de Excel rellena en los datos del paquete"},{"id":"C","en":"Export a configuration package","es":"Exportar un configuration package"},{"id":"D","en":"Apply the data","es":"Aplicar los datos"},{"id":"E","en":"Create a configuration package","es":"Crear un configuration package"},{"id":"F","en":"Export an Excel template and populate the data","es":"Exportar una plantilla de Excel y rellenar los datos"}]},{"id":"s1q12","type":"build","en":"A company implements Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The database contains very few posted entries. You observe that Global Dimension 1 is configured incorrectly.<br><br>You need to run the Change Global Dimensions function in Sequential mode to replace Global Dimension 1.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Una empresa implanta Business Central y su base de datos tiene muy pocos movimientos registrados. La Global Dimension 1 está mal configurada.<br><br>Debes ejecutar <b>Change Global Dimensions</b> en modo <b>Sequential</b> para sustituirla. ¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q12","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Sign out of Business Central, and then sign back in.","es":"Cerrar sesión en Business Central y volver a iniciarla."},{"id":"B","en":"Select the new dimension.","es":"Seleccionar la nueva dimensión."},{"id":"C","en":"Open General Ledger Setup.","es":"Abrir General Ledger Setup."},{"id":"D","en":"Select the Change Global Dimensions action.","es":"Seleccionar la acción Change Global Dimensions."},{"id":"E","en":"Select the Start action.","es":"Seleccionar la acción Start."},{"id":"F","en":"Select the Prepare action.","es":"Seleccionar la acción Prepare."}]},{"id":"s1q25","type":"build","en":"The company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. You create several dimensions that will be used to perform cost analyses.<br><br>Some dimension value combinations are not allowed when posting purchase transactions.<br><br>You need to set up dimension combinations.<br><br>In which order should you perform the actions? To answer, move all the actions from the .list of actions and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"La empresa usa Business Central y ha creado dimensiones para análisis de costes. Algunas combinaciones de valores de dimensión no se permiten en las compras.<br><br>Debes configurar las combinaciones de dimensiones. ¿En qué orden debes realizar todas las acciones?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q25","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Open the Dimensions Combinations page.","es":"Abrir la página Dimension Combinations."},{"id":"B","en":"Select the dimensions combination and set the option to Limited.","es":"Seleccionar la combinación de dimensiones y ponerla en Limited."},{"id":"C","en":"Open the Dimension Value Combinations page.","es":"Abrir la página Dimension Value Combinations."},{"id":"D","en":"Select the dimension value combinations and set the option to Blocked.","es":"Seleccionar las combinaciones de valores y ponerlas en Blocked."}]},{"id":"s1q31","type":"build","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. You assign a purchasing profile to all users in the purchasing department.<br><br>A user moves from the purchasing department to another department.<br><br>You need to remove all personalizations in the user's profile.<br><br>Which three actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Has asignado un perfil de compras a todo el departamento de compras. Un usuario cambia de departamento.<br><br>Debes eliminar todas las personalizaciones de su perfil. ¿Qué tres acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q31","slots":3,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Select the line for the page personalization that you want to delete and then select the Delete action.","es":"Seleccionar la línea de personalización a borrar y pulsar Delete."},{"id":"B","en":"Select User Settings and then select the related link.","es":"Buscar User Settings y abrir el enlace."},{"id":"C","en":"Navigate to the User Page Personalizations page.","es":"Ir a la página User Page Personalizations."},{"id":"D","en":"Open the User Settings card.","es":"Abrir la ficha User Settings del usuario."},{"id":"E","en":"Select Clear Personalized Pages.","es":"Seleccionar Clear Personalized Pages."}]},{"id":"s1q34","type":"build","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. You grant the financial bookkeeper the D365 ACCOUNTANTS permission set.<br><br>An auditor plans to perform an annual accounting audit. The auditor must have access to the same data as the bookkeeper but with view-only permission.<br><br>You need to create the permission set for the auditor.<br><br>In which order should you perform the actions? To answer, move all actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Has dado al contable el permission set <b>D365 ACCOUNTANTS</b>. Un auditor debe ver los mismos datos, pero solo en lectura.<br><br>Debes crear el permission set del auditor. ¿En qué orden debes realizar las acciones?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q34","slots":5,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"On the User Groups page select the D365 ACCOUNTANTS code.","es":"En la página User Groups, seleccionar el código D365 ACCOUNTANTS."},{"id":"B","en":"Edit the permissions for Permission Set AUDIT.","es":"Editar los permisos del permission set AUDIT."},{"id":"C","en":"Assign a New Permission Set name to AUDIT.","es":"Dar al nuevo permission set el nombre AUDIT."},{"id":"D","en":"On the Permission Sets page select the D365 ACCOUNTANTS permission set.","es":"En la página Permission Sets, seleccionar D365 ACCOUNTANTS."},{"id":"E","en":"Set the Insert, Modify, and Delete permissions to No for all permission lines.","es":"Poner Insert, Modify y Delete a No en todas las líneas."},{"id":"F","en":"Use the Copy Permission Sets function.","es":"Usar la función Copy Permission Set."}]},{"id":"s1q39","type":"build","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central. You group salespeople into teams and assign each team a Salesperson code.<br><br>A salesperson reports that they can see the sales orders for other sales team members.<br><br>You need to ensure that sales team members can only see sales orders that they create.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Has agrupado a los comerciales en equipos, cada uno con su Salesperson code. Un comercial ve los pedidos de venta de otros compañeros.<br><br>Debes conseguir que cada comercial solo vea los pedidos que crea. ¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q39","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Select the Security Filter column in Sales Header row.","es":"Seleccionar la columna Security Filter en la fila Sales Header."},{"id":"B","en":"Enter Salesperson/Purchase Code in User Setup.","es":"Introducir el Salesperson/Purchaser Code en User Setup."},{"id":"C","en":"Enter the Salesperson code.","es":"Introducir el código de comercial."},{"id":"D","en":"Select the field number for the Salesperson code.","es":"Seleccionar el número de campo de Salesperson Code."},{"id":"E","en":"Select the Permission set and select Permissions.","es":"Seleccionar el permission set y abrir Permissions."},{"id":"F","en":"Enter Sales Responsibility Center.","es":"Introducir el Sales Responsibility Center."}]},{"id":"s1q45","type":"build","en":"A company uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>You need to duplicate a company based on the existing Dynamics 365 Business Central company.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Debes duplicar una company existente de Business Central.<br><br>¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q45","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Open the data migration task.","es":"Abrir la tarea de migración de datos."},{"id":"B","en":"Select tables to copy.","es":"Seleccionar las tablas a copiar."},{"id":"C","en":"Select the Copy function.","es":"Seleccionar la función Copy."},{"id":"D","en":"Use the New function.","es":"Usar la función New."},{"id":"E","en":"Add the new company name.","es":"Indicar el nombre de la nueva company."},{"id":"F","en":"Open the assisted setup page.","es":"Abrir la página Assisted Setup."},{"id":"G","en":"Open the Companies page.","es":"Abrir la página Companies."},{"id":"H","en":"Select a company to copy.","es":"Seleccionar la company a copiar."}]},{"id":"s1q46","type":"build","en":"You set up a new company for a client. The client provides you with a Microsoft Excel file that contains master data for vendors and vendor bank accounts details.<br><br>You need to import vendor master data and relevant bank account details by using a configuration package.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Configuras una company nueva. El cliente te da un Excel con los datos de proveedores y sus cuentas bancarias.<br><br>Debes importarlos con un configuration package. ¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q46","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Import one Excel template that contains vendor and vendor bank account data.","es":"Importar una única plantilla de Excel con proveedores y sus cuentas bancarias."},{"id":"B","en":"Import two separate Excel files into the package, one for vendor data and one for bank account data.","es":"Importar dos Excel distintos, uno de proveedores y otro de cuentas bancarias."},{"id":"C","en":"Define the Vendor table as a parent in Parent Table ID for VendorBankAccount table.","es":"Definir Vendor como tabla padre (Parent Table ID) de Vendor Bank Account."},{"id":"D","en":"Create a configuration package.","es":"Crear un configuration package."},{"id":"E","en":"Define the VendorBankAccount table as a parent in Parent Table ID.","es":"Definir Vendor Bank Account como tabla padre."},{"id":"F","en":"Select Apply package on the header.","es":"Seleccionar Apply Package en la cabecera."}]},{"id":"s1q50","type":"build","en":"A company implements Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company stores master data for vendor opening balances in an Excel file. Most of the vendors use a foreign currency for open balances. The balancing account is preselected on the journal batch.<br><br>You need to import the vendor opening balances by using configuration packages.<br><br>Which four actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"La empresa tiene en un Excel los saldos de apertura de proveedores; la mayoría en divisa extranjera. La contrapartida ya está en la sección del diario.<br><br>Debes importarlos con configuration packages. ¿Qué cuatro acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q50","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Select the fields in the following processing order: Account Type, Account No., Posting Date, Document No., Description, Amount (LCY), Currency, and Amount.","es":"Seleccionar los campos en este orden: Account Type, Account No., Posting Date, Document No., Description, Amount (LCY), Currency y Amount."},{"id":"B","en":"Import the Excel file and validate the relationship. Then apply the data and post to the general journal.","es":"Importar el Excel y validar las relaciones; después aplicar los datos y registrar el diario general."},{"id":"C","en":"Select the fields in the following processing order: Account Type, Account No., Posting Date, Document No., Description, Amount, Amount (LCY), and Currency.","es":"Seleccionar los campos en este orden: Account Type, Account No., Posting Date, Document No., Description, Amount, Amount (LCY) y Currency."},{"id":"D","en":"Import from Excel and then post to the general journal.","es":"Importar desde Excel y registrar el diario general."},{"id":"E","en":"Export to Excel from the configuration package and populate the data.","es":"Exportar a Excel desde el paquete y rellenar los datos."},{"id":"F","en":"Select the fields in the following processing order: Account Type, Account No., Posting Date, Document No., Description, Currency Code, Amount, and Amount (LCY).","es":"Seleccionar los campos en este orden: Account Type, Account No., Posting Date, Document No., Description, Currency Code, Amount y Amount (LCY)."},{"id":"G","en":"Create a configuration package for table 81 Gen. Journal Line.","es":"Crear un configuration package para la tabla 81 Gen. Journal Line."}]},{"id":"s1q51","type":"build","en":"A company uses Business Central. The company recently restructured. The company has only a few posted entries.<br><br>You need to change the Global Dimensions in Business Central to reflect the restructure.<br><br>Which three actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Tras una reestructuración, debes cambiar las dimensiones globales. La empresa tiene pocos movimientos registrados.<br><br>¿Qué tres acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q51","slots":3,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Update Global Dimensions in parallel order.","es":"Actualizar las dimensiones globales en paralelo."},{"id":"B","en":"Select Parallel Processing on the Change Global Dimensions page.","es":"Seleccionar Parallel Processing en Change Global Dimensions."},{"id":"C","en":"Select new dimension codes in the dimension fields.","es":"Seleccionar los nuevos códigos de dimensión."},{"id":"D","en":"Update Global Dimensions in sequential order.","es":"Actualizar las dimensiones globales en modo secuencial."},{"id":"E","en":"On the General Ledger Setup page, select Change Global Dimensions.","es":"En General Ledger Setup, seleccionar Change Global Dimensions."}]},{"id":"s1q61","type":"build","en":"A company adds a user to Microsoft 365.<br><br>Existing security groups do not have the required permission sets for newly added users.<br><br>You need to assign a Dynamics 365 Business Central security group and permissions to the user and the company.<br><br>Which five actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.<br><br>NOTE: More than one order of answer choices is correct. You will receive credit for any of the correct orders you select.","es":"Una empresa añade un usuario en Microsoft 365. Los security groups existentes no tienen los permission sets necesarios.<br><br>Debes asignarle un security group de Business Central con permisos y la company. ¿Qué cinco acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q61","slots":5,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Pull the Security Group in Business Central.","es":"Traer el security group a Business Central."},{"id":"B","en":"Assign the user to the company.","es":"Asignar el usuario a la company."},{"id":"C","en":"Create a Microsoft 365 Security Group.","es":"Crear un security group en Microsoft 365."},{"id":"D","en":"Assign permissions to a security group.","es":"Asignar permisos al security group."},{"id":"E","en":"Assign the company to the user.","es":"Asignar la company al usuario."},{"id":"F","en":"Select Get New Users from Microsoft 365 / Update Users from Microsoft 365.","es":"Seleccionar Get New Users / Update Users from Microsoft 365."}]},{"id":"s1q62","type":"build","en":"A manufacturer uses Dynamics 365 Business Central.<br><br>The company has the following item types:<ul><li>Raw Materials</li><li>Work-in-progress (WIP)</li><li>Finished Goods</li></ul>Different prefixes are used for item numbers to identify these item types.<br><br>The company requires the following system setup:<ul><li>Use a unique number series for each item type.</li><li>No. Series must be selectable when creating manual items.</li><li>Implement automatic number assignment.</li></ul>You need to configure the system.<br><br>In which order should you perform the actions? To answer, move all actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.<br><br>NOTE: More than one order of answer choices is correct. You will receive credit for any of the correct orders you select.","es":"La empresa tiene artículos de tres tipos (materias primas, WIP y productos terminados), con prefijos distintos. Necesita una serie numérica por tipo, poder elegir la serie al crear artículos y numeración automática.<br><br>¿En qué orden debes realizar todas las acciones?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q62","slots":4,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"Enable the ability to use default numbers.","es":"Activar el uso de números por defecto (Default Nos.)."},{"id":"B","en":"Create a number series.","es":"Crear una serie numérica."},{"id":"C","en":"Create relationships between the number series.","es":"Crear relaciones entre las series numéricas."},{"id":"D","en":"Set the default number series on the Inventory Setup page.","es":"Indicar la serie por defecto en Inventory Setup."}]},{"id":"s1q63","type":"build","en":"A company uses Business Central and plans to automate its processes by using Power Automate.<br><br>The company finance manager wants to restrict access to Power Automate features. Only trained users must be able to create and run instant flows in Business Central.<br><br>You need to set up access control for specific users.<br><br>Which three actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.","es":"Una empresa usa Business Central y quiere automatizar procesos con Power Automate.<br><br>El responsable financiero quiere restringir el acceso: solo los usuarios formados podrán crear y ejecutar instant flows en Business Central.<br><br>¿Qué tres acciones debes realizar y en qué orden?","src":"Secuencial Topic 1 · Q63","slots":3,"actions":[{"id":"A","en":"As an administrator, agree to the integration notice on the Privacy Notices Status page on behalf of all users or allow users to decide themselves.","es":"Como administrador, aceptar el aviso de integración en la página Privacy Notices Status en nombre de todos los usuarios o dejar que decida cada uno."},{"id":"B","en":"Validate that authorized users have the Automate Action permission.","es":"Comprobar que los usuarios autorizados tienen el permiso Automate Action."},{"id":"C","en":"Add the system permission Allow Action Automate (ID 9630) to the assigned permissions sets.","es":"Añadir el permiso de sistema Allow Action Automate (ID 9630) a los permission sets asignados."},{"id":"D","en":"As an administrator, disagree to the integration notice on the Privacy Notices Status page on behalf of all users.","es":"Como administrador, rechazar el aviso de integración en la página Privacy Notices Status en nombre de todos los usuarios."},{"id":"E","en":"Remove the system permission Allow Action Automate (ID 9630) from the assigned permissions sets.","es":"Quitar el permiso de sistema Allow Action Automate (ID 9630) de los permission sets asignados."}]},{"id":"cs1t1q52","type":"hotspot","en":"You need to configure retail store customer cards to track revenue by market.<br>Which configuration should you use? To answer, select the appropriate option in the answer area.","es":"Debes configurar las fichas de los clientes de tiendas minoristas (retail) para seguir los ingresos por mercado.<br><br>¿Qué configuración debes usar?","src":"Case Study 1 · Topic 1 · Q52","case":"CS1","rowsHeader":["Action","Configuration"],"rows":[{"en":"Assign the dimension code.","es":"Asignar el código de dimensión.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Market","es":"Market"},{"id":"b","en":"Location","es":"Location"},{"id":"c","en":"Department","es":"Department"},{"id":"d","en":"Product Category","es":"Product Category"}]},{"en":"Assign the dimension value code.","es":"Asignar el código de valor de dimensión.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Sales","es":"Sales"},{"id":"b","en":"Retail","es":"Retail"},{"id":"c","en":"Treats","es":"Treats"},{"id":"d","en":"Breeder","es":"Breeder"}]},{"en":"Select a value posting.","es":"Seleccionar el value posting.","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Blank","es":"Blank"},{"id":"b","en":"No code","es":"No code"},{"id":"c","en":"Same code","es":"Same code"},{"id":"d","en":"Code mandatory","es":"Code mandatory"}]}]},{"id":"cs2t1q65","type":"hotspot","en":"You need to recommend integration solutions to fulfill the company requirements.<br>Which Microsoft integration aligns with each requirement?","es":"Debes recomendar soluciones de integración que cumplan los requisitos de la empresa.<br><br>¿Qué integración de Microsoft corresponde a cada requisito?","src":"Case Study 2 · Topic 1 · Q65","case":"CS2","rowsHeader":["Customer requirement","Integration"],"rows":[{"en":"Customer email collaboration","es":"Colaboración con clientes por email","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Business Central Outlook add-in","es":"Business Central Outlook add-in"},{"id":"b","en":"Business Central app for Teams","es":"Business Central app for Teams"},{"id":"c","en":"Word template","es":"Word template"},{"id":"d","en":"Power Automate","es":"Power Automate"}]},{"en":"Sales team collaboration","es":"Colaboración del equipo de ventas","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Business Central Outlook add-in","es":"Business Central Outlook add-in"},{"id":"b","en":"Business Central app for Teams","es":"Business Central app for Teams"},{"id":"c","en":"Word template","es":"Word template"},{"id":"d","en":"Power Automate","es":"Power Automate"}]},{"en":"Customer notifications for sales campaign","es":"Notificaciones a clientes de una campaña de ventas","options":[{"id":"a","en":"Business Central Outlook add-in","es":"Business Central Outlook add-in"},{"id":"b","en":"Business Central app for Teams","es":"Business Central app for Teams"},{"id":"c","en":"Word template","es":"Word template"},{"id":"d","en":"Power Automate","es":"Power Automate"}]}]},{"id":"cs2t1q66","type":"mr","en":"You need to configure workflows to meet the order processing requirements of the company.<br>Which two solutions should you use? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.","es":"Debes configurar los flujos de trabajo (workflows) para cumplir los requisitos de procesamiento de pedidos de la empresa.<br><br>¿Qué dos soluciones debes usar?","src":"Case Study 2 · Topic 1 · Q66","case":"CS2","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Create a purchase order approval workflow.","es":"Crear un workflow de aprobación de pedidos de compra."},{"id":"B","en":"Use Business Central as the engine for the workflow.","es":"Usar Business Central como motor del workflow."},{"id":"C","en":"Use Power Automate as the engine for the workflow.","es":"Usar Power Automate como motor del workflow."},{"id":"D","en":"Create a purchase invoice approval workflow.","es":"Crear un workflow de aprobación de facturas de compra."}],"select":2},{"id":"cs2t1q67","type":"drag","en":"You need to create financial reports per company reporting requirements.<br>Which report configuration should you use to add the report descriptions to financial reports?","es":"Debes crear informes financieros según los requisitos de la empresa.<br><br>¿Qué configuración debes usar para añadir cada descripción a los informes?","src":"Case Study 2 · Topic 1 · Q67","case":"CS2","valuesTitle":"Report configurations","targetHeader":["Report description","Report configuration"],"values":[{"id":"V1","en":"Row definition","es":"Row definition"},{"id":"V2","en":"Column definition","es":"Column definition"},{"id":"V3","en":"Financial Report page","es":"Financial Report page"},{"id":"V4","en":"G/L account categories","es":"G/L account categories"},{"id":"V5","en":"Create financial reports","es":"Create financial reports"}],"targets":[{"en":"Headcount","es":"Headcount (plantilla)"},{"en":"Square Footage","es":"Square Footage (superficie)"},{"en":"Income, Retail","es":"Income, Retail"},{"en":"Accounts Receivables, Wholesale","es":"Accounts Receivables, Wholesale"}]}]};
